"Debugging: Log AI chat traffic to the system console.\nEmits per-turn user / agent / tool entries via NSFuckingLog so you can trace exactly what the agent received and produced. Useful for debugging tool dispatch and history translation. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue." = "调试： 将 AI 对话流量记录到系统控制台。\n通过 NSFuckingLog 逐轮输出用户 / 代理 / 工具条目，让你可以精确追踪代理接收和产出的内容。用于调试工具分发和历史记录翻译。默认关闭；仅在复现问题时开启。";
"Debugging: Log a detailed trace when a session’s foreground-job ancestor list unexpectedly shrinks.\nWhen an intermediate ancestor (such as the claude CLI) drops out of a tracked session’s foreground-job ancestry for a single process-cache update, log via RLog which pid held the vanished ancestor, whether it is still in the process table, and the full upward walk from the deepest foreground job. Used to diagnose spurious job-ended events that can tear down a Claude Code workgroup. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue." = "调试： 当会话的前台作业祖先列表意外缩小时，记录详细的跟踪信息。\n当中间祖先（如 claude CLI）在某次进程缓存更新中从被跟踪会话的前台作业谱系中消失时，通过 RLog 记录是哪个 pid 持有该消失的祖先、它是否仍在进程表中，以及从最深前台作业开始的完整向上遍历。用于诊断可能导致 Claude Code 工作组被拆除的虚假作业结束事件。默认关闭；仅在复现问题时开启。";
"Debugging: Log raw AI API requests and responses to disk.\nWrites every byte sent to and received from the AI vendor (full request headers, body, streaming chunks, final response, errors, and timing) to ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/AIChatWire/. One log file per app launch; rotate or delete it yourself when done. WARNING: the log captures Authorization / API-key headers and full prompt + response content verbatim. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue and delete the files when finished." = "调试： 将原始 AI API 请求和响应记录到磁盘。\n将发送给和接收自 AI 供应商的每一个字节（完整请求头、正文、流式分块、最终响应、错误和耗时）写入 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/AIChatWire/。每次启动应用生成一个日志文件；完成后请自行轮转或删除。警告：日志会逐字记录 Authorization / API 密钥请求头以及完整的提示词和响应内容。默认关闭；仅在复现问题时开启，并在完成后删除这些文件。";
"Debugging: Log restorable state size info to /tmp/statesize.*.txt." = "调试： 将可恢复状态的大小信息记录到 /tmp/statesize.*.txt。";
"Debugging: Log stats about text drawing performance to console.\nUsed for performance testing." = "调试： 将文本绘制性能统计记录到控制台。\n用于性能测试。";
"Debugging: Outline dirty rects in the legacy renderer with random colors.\nUseful for visually verifying which regions of the text view are being repainted each frame. This affects only the legacy (non-GPU) renderer and does nothing when the GPU (Metal) renderer is active, so it is not a way to tell whether the GPU renderer is engaged. To use it, first turn off the GPU renderer in Settings → General → Magic." = "调试： 用随机颜色勾勒传统渲染器的脏矩形。\n用于直观验证文本视图每一帧重绘了哪些区域。这仅影响传统（非 GPU）渲染器，在 GPU（Metal）渲染器启用时无效，因此不能用来判断 GPU 渲染器是否启用。要使用此功能，请先在「设置 → 通用 → Magic」中关闭 GPU 渲染器。";
"Debugging: Override the local hostname used for localhost detection.\nWhen non-empty, the app behaves as though [NSHost fullyQualifiedDomainName] returns this value. Lets you test how localhost detection reacts to a hostname change without actually renaming your computer. Affects hosts reported after you change it; leave empty to use the real hostname." = "调试： 覆盖用于 localhost 检测的本地主机名。\n非空时，应用会表现得如同 [NSHost fullyQualifiedDomainName] 返回此值。让你无需实际重命名计算机即可测试 localhost 检测对主机名变更的反应。更改后会影响报告的主机名；留空则使用真实主机名。";
"Debugging: Show line buffer block boundaries (issue 6207)" = "调试： 显示行缓冲区块边界（issue 6207）";
"Debugging: Start debug logging automatically when iTerm2 is launched." = "调试： iTerm2 启动时自动开始调试日志。";
