"Do Not Remap Modifiers" = "不重映射修饰键";
"Don’t Copy" = "不复制";
"Don’t Load Remote Settings" = "不加载远程设置";
"Dot:" = "点：";
"Drawing: Allow HDR effects\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 may render some UI effects, such as the selected tab's outline, brighter than white on an HDR-capable display. Off by default because forcing the display into extended dynamic range can cause hangs on some systems." = "绘制： 允许 HDR 效果\n启用后，iTerm2 可能会在支持 HDR 的显示器上将某些 UI 效果（如选中标签页的轮廓）渲染得比白色更亮。默认关闭，因为强制显示器进入扩展动态范围可能导致某些系统卡顿。";
"Drawing: Alpha value for shade that covers areas outside the currently selected command." = "绘制： 覆盖当前选中命令之外区域的遮罩 alpha 值。";
"Drawing: Always use line-style marks?" = "绘制： 始终使用线条样式标记？";
"Drawing: Animate graph-based status bar components?\nTurn this off to reduce CPU/GPU usage in WindowServer." = "绘制： 为基于图表的状态栏组件添加动画？\n关闭此项可降低 WindowServer 的 CPU/GPU 使用率。";
"Drawing: Disable adaptive framerate in interactive apps.\nTurn off adaptive frame rate while in alternate screen mode for more consistent refresh rate. This works even if alternate screen mode is disabled." = "绘制： 在交互式应用中禁用自适应帧率。\n在备用屏幕模式下关闭自适应帧率以获得更一致的刷新率。即使禁用了备用屏幕模式，此设置也有效。";
"Drawing: Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?\nThis includes the following indicators: maximized pane, broadcast input, coprocess running, alert on next mark, output suppression, zoom, copy mode, and debug logging." = "绘制： 禁用会话右上角出现的指示器图标？\n这包括以下指示器：最大化分屏面板、广播输入、协进程运行中、下次标记提醒、输出抑制、缩放、复制模式以及调试日志。";
"Drawing: Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?\nThis matches how most “nerd” fonts render them, but your favorite one might not do this. An example code point that is affected is U+E0B8." = "绘制： 将某些 Powerline 符号绘制为双宽？\n这匹配大多数“nerd”字体的渲染方式，但您喜欢的字体可能不这样做。受影响的示例码位是 U+E0B8。";
"Drawing: Draw outline around underline and vertical bar cursors using background color." = "绘制： 使用背景颜色为下划线和竖条光标绘制轮廓。";
"Drawing: Duration in seconds for smooth cursor slide animation.\nThis affects the \"Smooth slide\" cursor movement option." = "绘制： 平滑光标滑动动画的时长（秒）。\n这影响“平滑滑动”光标移动选项。";
"Drawing: Duration in seconds for the “Animate large movements” cursor animation." = "绘制： “大移动量动画”光标动画的时长（秒）。";
"Drawing: Enable cache of double-width character locations?\nThis should improve performance. It is always on in nightly builds. You must restart iTerm2 for this setting to take effect." = "绘制： 启用双宽字符位置缓存？\n这应能提升性能。在 nightly 构建中始终开启。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Drawing: Enable contextual alternates (calt) for ligature-capable fonts.\nWhen enabled, uses ligature level 2 which activates calt in addition to standard ligatures. Many coding fonts such as Monaspace, Iosevka, and Cascadia Code require this for their ligatures to work." = "绘制： 为支持连字的字体启用上下文备选 (calt)。\n启用后，使用连字级别 2，除了标准连字外还激活 calt。许多编程字体（如 Monaspace、Iosevka 和 Cascadia Code）需要此功能才能使其连字生效。";
"Drawing: Force text to be anti-aliased on Retina displays.\nEnable this to use non-AA text on non-retina displays, which sometimes looks better." = "绘制： 在 Retina 显示器上强制文本抗锯齿。\n启用此项可在非 Retina 显示器上使用非抗锯齿文本，有时看起来更好。";
"Drawing: Frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is enabled and throughput is low but not 0." = "绘制： 启用自适应帧率且吞吐量较低但非 0 时的帧率（FPS）。";
"Drawing: GPU renderer redraws at least this often, in seconds.\nThis is to work around a problem where the GPU renderer encounters a lot of latency when drawing for the first time after a short period of inactivity. Set this to a big number to render it ineffectual." = "绘制： GPU 渲染器至少以此频率重绘（秒）。\n这是为了解决 GPU 渲染器在短暂不活动后首次绘制时遇到大量延迟的问题。将此值设为一个较大的数字可使其失效。";
"Drawing: HDR cursor\nExperimental. Half-baked. Probably don't use this." = "绘制： HDR 光标\n实验性功能。尚未完善。建议不要使用。";
"Drawing: Improves drawing performance at the expense of disallowing alphanumeric characters to belong to ligatures." = "绘制： 以不允许字母数字字符属于连字为代价提升绘制性能。";
"Drawing: Include extended symbols when drawing Powerline natively." = "绘制： 原生绘制 Powerline 时包含扩展符号。";
"Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is disabled.\nNote: this is doubled on ARM Macs for displays that support at least 120hz. Modifications to this setting will not affect existing sessions." = "绘制： 禁用自适应帧率时的最大帧率（FPS）。\n注意：在支持至少 120hz 的显示器上，ARM Mac 上此值翻倍。修改此设置不会影响现有会话。";
"Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when low power mode is enabled." = "绘制： 启用低电量模式时的最大帧率（FPS）。";
"Drawing: Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation.\nCursor movements larger than this will not animate." = "绘制： 平滑光标滑动动画的最大水平距离（单元格）。\n大于此值的光标移动不会产生动画。";
"Drawing: Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?\nFor this to be effective you must disable “Disable Metal renderer when not connected to power”." = "绘制： 未连接电源时 Metal 渲染器使用集成 GPU？\n要使其生效，您必须禁用“未连接电源时禁用 Metal 渲染器”。";
"Drawing: Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font.\nThis affects selection of the bold version of a font. Font weights go from 0 to 9. If no font can be found that has a high enough weight then the regular font will be double-struck with a small offset." = "绘制： 常规字体与粗体之间的最小字重差异。\n这影响字体粗体版本的选择。字体字重从 0 到 9。如果找不到字重足够高的字体，则常规字体将以小偏移双重描边。";
"Drawing: Path to CSS file to customize native drawing (for dark background colors)." = "绘制： 用于自定义原生绘制的 CSS 文件路径（用于深色背景颜色）。";
"Drawing: Path to CSS file to customize native drawing (for light background colors)." = "绘制： 用于自定义原生绘制的 CSS 文件路径（用于浅色背景颜色）。";
"Drawing: Prefer speed to accuracy for characters with combining marks?" = "绘制： 对于带组合标记的字符，优先速度而非精度？";
"Drawing: Show FPS meter\nRequires Metal renderer" = "绘制： 显示 FPS 计量表\n需要 Metal 渲染器";
"Drawing: Show URL preview on cmd-hover for semantic history matches." = "绘制： 在按住 ⌘ 悬停时为语义历史匹配显示 URL 预览。";
"Drawing: Thickness of underline cursor." = "绘制： 下划线光标的粗细。";
"Drawing: Throughput threshold for adaptive frame rate.\nIf more than this many bytes per second are received, use the lower frame rate of 30 fps." = "绘制： 自适应帧率的吞吐量阈值。\n如果每秒接收的字节数超过此值，则使用较低的 30 fps 帧率。";
"Drawing: Underline OSC 8 hyperlinks" = "绘制： 为 OSC 8 超链接添加下划线。";
"Drawing: Use GCD-based update timer instead of NSTimer.\nThis should cause more regular screen updates. Restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "绘制： 使用基于 GCD 的更新计时器而非 NSTimer。\n这应能使屏幕更新更规律。更改此设置后重启 iTerm2。";
"Drawing: Use adaptive framerate.\nWhen throughput is low, the screen will update at 60 frames per second. When throughput is higher, it will drop to a configurable rate (15 fps by default)." = "绘制： 使用自适应帧率。\n当吞吐量较低时，屏幕以每秒 60 帧更新。当吞吐量较高时，会降至可配置的速率（默认 15 fps）。";
"Drawing: Use multi-pass underline renderer?\nFixes underline gaps with ligature fonts. Requires restart." = "绘制： 使用多遍下划线渲染器？\n修复连字字体的下划线间隙。需要重启。";
"Drawing: Use solid underlines?\nWhen disabled, underlines break near text that would intersect them." = "绘制： 使用实线下划线？\n禁用后，下划线在与文字相交处断开。";
"Drawing: Use your typeface’s box-drawing characters instead of iTerm2’s custom drawing code.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "绘制： 使用您字体的制表符而非 iTerm2 的自定义绘制代码。\n更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2。";
"Drawing: Use zippy text drawing algorithm?\nThis draws non-ASCII text more quickly but with lower fidelity. This setting is ignored if ligatures are enabled in Settings > Profiles > Text." = "绘制： 使用快速文本绘制算法？\n此算法绘制非 ASCII 文本速度更快但保真度较低。如果在“设置 > 配置文件 > 文本”中启用了连字，此设置将被忽略。";
"Drawing: When adaptive framerate is enabled and using the Metal renderer, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS)." = "绘制： 启用自适应帧率并使用 Metal 渲染器时，在高吞吐量条件下以此速率刷新（FPS）。";
"Drawing: When adaptive framerate is enabled, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS).\n Does not apply to Metal renderer." = "绘制： 启用自适应帧率时，在高吞吐量条件下以此速率刷新（FPS）。\n不适用于 Metal 渲染器。";
"Drawing: When animated cursor movement is enabled, only perform animation if the cursor moves at least this distance in points." = "绘制： 启用光标移动动画时，仅当光标移动距离至少为此值（点）时才执行动画。";
"Duplicate" = "创建副本";
"Duplicate Tab" = "创建标签页副本";
"Duration in seconds for the cursor to fade in when smooth blink is enabled" = "启用平滑闪烁时光标淡入的持续时间（秒）";
"Duration in seconds for the cursor to fade out when smooth blink is enabled" = "启用平滑闪烁时光标淡出的持续时间（秒）";
"Easing curve for the cursor fade-in (0=linear, 1=ease in, 2=ease out, 3=ease in-out)" = "光标淡入的缓动曲线（0=线性，1=缓入，2=缓出，3=缓入缓出）";
"Easing curve for the cursor fade-out (0=linear, 1=ease in, 2=ease out, 3=ease in-out)" = "光标淡出的缓动曲线（0=线性，1=缓入，2=缓出，3=缓入缓出）";
"Economy model" = "经济型模型";
"Edit" = "编辑";
"Edit Manual AI Model" = "编辑手动 AI 模型";
"Edit Session" = "编辑会话";
"Empty Default" = "清空默认值";
"Emulate US Keyboard" = "模拟美式键盘";
"Enabled" = "启用";
"Endpoint" = "端点";
"Enter URL" = "输入 URL";
"Enter URL." = "输入 URL。";
"Enter a header name and value. The name is required." = "请输入请求头名称和值。名称为必填项。";
"Enter a model name and URL before testing the connection." = "在测试连接前请输入模型名称和 URL。";
"Enter command" = "输入命令";
"Enter command to run" = "输入要运行的命令";
"Enter coprocess command" = "输入协进程命令";
"Enter file name" = "输入文件名";
"Enter function invocation" = "输入函数调用";
"Enter interpolated string (evaluated in session context)" = "输入插值字符串（在会话上下文中求值）";
"Enter name of menu item" = "输入菜单项名称";
"Enter text" = "输入文本";
"Enter tmux command" = "输入 tmux 命令";
"Enter value to send" = "输入要发送的值";
"Enter value to send. Click help button for special characters." = "输入要发送的值。点击帮助按钮查看特殊字符。";
"Error" = "错误";
"Error Loading Settings" = "加载设置时出错";
"Error saving to %@: %@" = "保存到 %@ 时出错：%@";
"Esc +" = "Esc +";
"Esc+" = "Esc+";
"Escaping" = "转义";
"Exclude From Dock and App Switcher" = "从程序坞和应用切换器中排除";
"Experimental Features: AI model name substrings that use the modern 'completions' API.\nSubstrings should be space-delimited. This handles OpenRouter-style names like 'openai/gpt-4o'. Note that o1 models use a different API and have hard-coded behavior." = "实验性功能： 使用现代 'completions' API 的 AI 模型名称子字符串。\n子字符串应以空格分隔。这处理 OpenRouter 风格的名称，如 'openai/gpt-4o'。注意 o1 模型使用不同的 API，行为已硬编码。";
"Experimental Features: Add path to iTerm2 utilities to $PATH for new sessions?" = "实验性功能： 为新会话将 iTerm2 实用工具路径添加到 $PATH？";
"Experimental Features: After this many commands, make codecierge confirm that you intend to keep it enabled." = "实验性功能： 执行这么多命令后，让 codecierge 确认你打算保持其启用。";
"Experimental Features: Aggressively keep windows on the screen they were configured to be on" = "实验性功能： 强制将窗口保留在配置时所在的屏幕上";
"Experimental Features: Allow function keys to be handled by macOS text input system.\nThis supports using function keys with modifiers as compose/dead keys in custom keyboard layouts." = "实验性功能： 允许功能键由 macOS 文本输入系统处理。\n这支持在自定义键盘布局中将带修饰符的功能键用作组合键/死键。";
"Experimental Features: Allow variable window sizes in tmux integration.\nRequres tmux version 2.9 or later." = "实验性功能： 在 tmux 集成中允许可变窗口大小。\n需要 tmux 2.9 或更高版本。";
"Experimental Features: Auto-detect paragraph writing direction based on the first strong directional character?\nRequires right-to-left text support to be enabled." = "实验性功能： 根据第一个强方向字符自动检测段落书写方向？\n需要启用从右到左文本支持。";
"Experimental Features: Automatically restore keyboard mode when an ssh session ends?" = "实验性功能： ssh 会话结束时自动恢复键盘模式？";
"Experimental Features: Automatically search for selected text after making a selection?" = "实验性功能： 进行选区后自动搜索选中的文本？";
"Experimental Features: Cache per-row GPU build output?\nSkips rebuilding the glyph and color data for rows whose content and configuration have not changed since the last frame. Experimental." = "实验性功能： 缓存逐行 GPU 构建输出？\n跳过对自上一帧以来内容和配置未更改的行重建字形和颜色数据。实验性功能。";
"Experimental Features: Clear bell icon when a session becomes active.\nWhen off, you must type in the session to clear the bell icon." = "实验性功能： 会话变为活跃时清除响铃图标。\n关闭时，你必须在会话中输入才能清除响铃图标。";
"Experimental Features: Detect base unicode characters with lookup table.\nApple's algorithm for segmenting composed characters makes bad choices, such as for Tamil. Enable this to reduce text overlapping." = "实验性功能： 使用查找表检测基础 Unicode 字符。\nApple 的组合字符分割算法会做出糟糕的选择，例如对泰米尔语。启用此项可减少文本重叠。";
"Experimental Features: Disable metal renderer when idle to save CPU utilization?\nRequires Metal renderer" = "实验性功能： 空闲时禁用 Metal 渲染器以节省 CPU 占用？\n需要 Metal 渲染器";
"Experimental Features: Disclaim ownership of children.\nBy enabling this, when launching a Cocoa app from a terminal window TCC should attribute ownership to the app, not iTerm2, for permissions. In order for changes to this setting to take effect, you must kill iTermServer." = "实验性功能： 放弃子进程的所有权。\n启用此项后，从终端窗口启动 Cocoa 应用时，TCC 应将权限所有权归于该应用而非 iTerm2。要使此设置的更改生效，你必须终止 iTermServer。";
"Experimental Features: Dismember scroll view for better GPU performance?\nThis enables a dangerous hack that might improve drawing performance on macOS 10.14 only." = "实验性功能： 拆分滚动视图以获得更好的 GPU 性能？\n这会启用一个危险的 hack，可能仅在 macOS 10.14 上提升绘制性能。";
"Experimental Features: Enable AquaSKK bugfix?" = "实验性功能： 启用 AquaSKK bug 修复？";
"Experimental Features: Enable Channels feature?" = "实验性功能： 启用 Channels 功能？";
"Experimental Features: Enable browser-style profiles?\nYou must restart iTerm2 for this to take effect." = "实验性功能： 启用浏览器风格的配置文件？\n你必须重启 iTerm2 此设置才能生效。";
"Experimental Features: Enable character accent menu.\nThis disables the ordinary key repeat behavior for press-and-hold. You must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect." = "实验性功能： 启用字符重音菜单。\n这会禁用按住的普通按键重复行为。你必须重启 iTerm2 此更改才会生效。";
"Experimental Features: Enable low-latency updates of the current foreground job" = "实验性功能： 启用当前前台作业的低延迟更新";
"Experimental Features: Enable more compact logging when using auto composer?\nThis will avoid logging raw data in your prompt and your interactions with it. Instead, the prompt is logged once in plain text and the command is logged when sent." = "实验性功能： 使用自动编辑器时启用更紧凑的日志？\n这将避免记录提示词和与其交互的原始数据。取而代之，提示词以纯文本记录一次，命令在发送时记录。";
"Experimental Features: Enable multi-server daemon.\nA new implementation of session restoration that combines daemon processes." = "实验性功能： 启用多服务器守护进程。\n会话恢复的新实现，合并了守护进程。";
"Experimental Features: Enable restorable state controller?\nThis makes window restoration more reliable." = "实验性功能： 启用可恢复状态控制器？\n这使窗口恢复更可靠。";
"Experimental Features: Enable support for REP (Repeat previous character) escape sequence?" = "实验性功能： 启用对 REP（重复上一个字符）转义序列的支持？";
"Experimental Features: Escape file names with single quotes instead of backslashes.\nThis is intended for users of xonsh, which does not accept backslash escaping." = "实验性功能： 用单引号而不是反斜杠转义文件名。\n这面向 xonsh 用户，xonsh 不接受反斜杠转义。";
"Experimental Features: Extend background color into margins in alternate screen mode?" = "实验性功能： 在备用屏幕模式下将背景颜色延伸到边距？";
"Experimental Features: Fast regular expression evaluation for triggers.\nThis is experimental because it could potentially change how regular expressions are interpreted." = "实验性功能： 触发器的快速正则表达式求值。\n这是实验性的，因为它可能改变正则表达式的解释方式。";
"Experimental Features: Flag emoji render full-width" = "实验性功能： 国旗 emoji 全宽渲染";
"Experimental Features: Host and port for proxy for AI requests.\ni.e., example.com:8080" = "实验性功能： AI 请求代理的主机和端口。\n例如 example.com：8080";
"Experimental Features: Improved support for input method editors like AquaSKK." = "实验性功能： 改进对 AquaSKK 等输入法编辑器的支持。";
"Experimental Features: Kill sessions on logout.\nA possible fix for issue 4147." = "实验性功能： 注销时终止会话。\n可能是 issue 4147 的修复方案。";
"Experimental Features: List of fonts to use alternate rounding algorithm for line height calculation.\nThis fixes consolas and emulates Terminal.app’s behavior on macOS 10.15. This is a comma-delimited list of font family substrings." = "实验性功能： 使用备用舍入算法计算行高的字体列表。\n这修复了 consolas 并模拟 Terminal.app 在 macOS 10.15 上的行为。这是以逗号分隔的字体族子字符串列表。";
"Experimental Features: Log a histogram of non-ASCII string lengths periodically.\nUseful for tuning the async pre-conversion minimum string length." = "实验性功能： 定期记录非 ASCII 字符串长度的直方图。\n用于调优异步预转换的最小字符串长度。";
"Experimental Features: Make the tab bar a titlebar accessory view in Big Sur?" = "实验性功能： 在 Big Sur 中将标签栏设为标题栏附件视图？";
"Experimental Features: Make uploads with it2ul really fast." = "实验性功能： 让使用 it2ul 的上传非常快。";
"Experimental Features: Maximum bytes of outstanding async pre-conversions.\nWhen this limit is reached, new strings are converted synchronously on the mutation thread." = "实验性功能： 未完成的异步预转换的最大字节数。\n达到此限制时，新字符串在变更线程上同步转换。";
"Experimental Features: Minimum string length (in UTF-16 code units) to dispatch for async pre-conversion." = "实验性功能： 分派给异步预转换的最小字符串长度（以 UTF-16 码元为单位）。";
"Experimental Features: Mouse wheel always scrolls when scroll bars are visible" = "实验性功能： 滚动条可见时鼠标滚轮始终滚动";
"Experimental Features: Post fake flags-changed events when remapping modifiers with an event tap.\nThis is an attempt to work around incompatibilities with AltTab in issue 10220." = "实验性功能： 使用事件探针重映射修饰符时发送虚假的 flags-changed 事件。\n这是尝试规避 issue 10220 中与 AltTab 的不兼容问题。";
"Experimental Features: Pre-convert long non-ASCII strings on a background queue.\nThis decouples preconversion from the parser thread for better throughput." = "实验性功能： 在后台队列上预转换长的非 ASCII 字符串。\n这将预转换与解析器线程解耦，以获得更好的吞吐量。";
"Experimental Features: Pre-convert non-ASCII strings to screen characters on the parser thread.\nThis exploits parallelism between parsing and screen mutation for better performance." = "实验性功能： 在解析器线程上将非 ASCII 字符串预转换为屏幕字符。\n这利用了解析和屏幕变更之间的并行性以获得更好的性能。";
"Experimental Features: Prompt to send to LLM for Codecierge when it is NOT able to execute commands automatically.\n$GOAL and $CONTEXT are replaced with the user-specified goal and info about the running environment, respectively." = "实验性功能： Codecierge 不能自动执行命令时发送给 LLM 的提示词。\n$GOAL 和 $CONTEXT 分别替换为用户指定的目标和运行环境的信息。";
"Experimental Features: Prompt to send to LLM for Codecierge when it is able to execute commands automatically.\n$GOAL and $CONTEXT are replaced with the user-specified goal and info about the running environment, respectively." = "实验性功能： Codecierge 能够自动执行命令时发送给 LLM 的提示词。\n$GOAL 和 $CONTEXT 分别替换为用户指定的目标和运行环境的信息。";
"Experimental Features: Reduce number of frames in flight when GPU can't produce drawables quickly." = "实验性功能： 当 GPU 无法快速生成 drawable 时减少飞行中的帧数。";
"Experimental Features: Report 16-bit color values to OSC 4 and 10 through 19.\nWorks around a bug in older vim where they could not properly parse 8-bit values." = "实验性功能： 向 OSC 4 和 10 到 19 报告 16 位颜色值。\n规避旧版 vim 无法正确解析 8 位值的 bug。";
"Experimental Features: Report multiple mouse scroll events when scrolling quickly?" = "实验性功能： 快速滚动时报告多个鼠标滚动事件？";
"Experimental Features: Reset colors at shell prompt?\nUses shell integration to detect a shell prompt and, if enabled, resets colors to their defaults." = "实验性功能： 在 shell 提示符处重置颜色？\n使用 shell integration 检测 shell 提示符，并在启用时将颜色重置为默认值。";
"Experimental Features: Right-justify lines in paragraphs with base writing direction of right-to-left?\nRequires BOTH “right-to-left text support” and “auto-detect paragraph writing detection” to be enabled." = "实验性功能： 在基础书写方向为从右到左的段落中将行右对齐？\n需要同时启用「从右到左文本支持」和「自动检测段落书写方向」。";
"Experimental Features: SSH URLs respect the path.\nThey run the command: ssh -t \"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\$SHELL -l\"" = "实验性功能： SSH URL 遵循路径。\n它们运行命令：ssh -t \"cd $$PATH$$； exec \\$SHELL -l\"";
"Experimental Features: Save unlimited amount of window contents.\nThis is going to be slow unless you enable SQLite-based window restoration too." = "实验性功能： 保存无限量的窗口内容。\n除非你也启用基于 SQLite 的窗口恢复，否则这会很慢。";
"Experimental Features: Set LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2.\nopenssh and mosh pass this to hosts you connect to. It communicates the current terminal emulator. This is useful for enabling terminal emulator-specific features." = "实验性功能： 设置 LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2。\nopenssh 和 mosh 会将此传递给你连接的主机。它传达当前终端模拟器。这对启用终端模拟器特定功能很有用。";
"Experimental Features: Show inline images at Retina resolution." = "实验性功能： 以 Retina 分辨率显示内联图像。";
"Experimental Features: Show prompt locations in scroll bar?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart. You must also enable “Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar” for this to take effect." = "实验性功能： 在滚动条中显示提示符位置？\n更改此设置在重启前不会影响现有会话。你还必须启用「在滚动条中显示搜索结果和提示符位置」此项才能生效。";
"Experimental Features: Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar.\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart." = "实验性功能： 在滚动条中显示搜索结果和提示符位置。\n更改此设置在重启前不会影响现有会话。";
"Experimental Features: Stamp frame numbers into the iTerm2 Buddy live stream?\nDraws a monotonic counter onto each streamed video frame, for debugging the phone’s live session view." = "实验性功能： 在 iTerm2 Buddy 实时流中盖印帧编号？\n在每个流式视频帧上绘制单调递增计数器，用于调试手机的实时会话视图。";
"Experimental Features: Store window restoration state in SQLite" = "实验性功能： 将窗口恢复状态存储在 SQLite 中";
"Experimental Features: Support DECSET 1036?\nThis allows apps in the terminal to control whether the option key sends esc+ or acts like a regular option key." = "实验性功能： 支持 DECSET 1036？\n这允许终端中的应用控制 option 键是发送 esc+ 还是作为普通 option 键。";
"Experimental Features: Support modifier remapping for keystrokes originated by Synergy." = "实验性功能： 支持对 Synergy 发起的按键进行修饰符重映射。";
"Experimental Features: Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth in all modes?" = "实验性功能： 支持变体选择符 16 在所有模式下使 emoji 全宽？";
"Experimental Features: Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth outside of alternate screen mode?" = "实验性功能： 支持变体选择符 16 在备用屏幕模式之外使 emoji 全宽？";
"Experimental Features: Trackpad scrolls fast?\nSet to No for legacy scrolling speed." = "实验性功能： 触控板快速滚动？\n设为「否」以使用旧版滚动速度。";
"Experimental Features: Treat the equals sign on the numeric keypad as a key on the numeric keypad.\nFor mysterious reasons, macOS does not treat this key as belonging to the numeric keypad. Enable this setting to work around the bug." = "实验性功能： 将数字小键盘上的等号视为数字小键盘上的键。\n出于神秘原因，macOS 不将该键视为属于数字小键盘。启用此设置可规避该 bug。";
"Experimental Features: Use a more theoretically correct technique to measure line height.\nYou must restart iTerm2 or adjust a session's font size for this change to take effect." = "实验性功能： 使用理论上更正确的方法来测量行高。\n你必须重启 iTerm2 或调整会话的字体大小此更改才会生效。";
"Experimental Features: Use modern scroll wheel accumulator.\nThis should support wheel mice better and feel more natural." = "实验性功能： 使用现代滚轮累加器。\n这应能更好地支持滚轮鼠标并感觉更自然。";
"Experimental Features: Use synchronized Metal drawable presentation?\nDefers drawable acquisition until rendering completes, presents synchronously with Core Animation, and acquires drawables on the private render queue. May improve frame rates." = "实验性功能： 使用同步的 Metal drawable 呈现？\n将 drawable 获取延迟到渲染完成，与 Core Animation 同步呈现，并在私有渲染队列上获取 drawable。可能提升帧率。";
"Experimental Features: When right-to-left text support is enabled, also support it in alternate screen mode?" = "实验性功能： 启用从右到左文本支持时，在备用屏幕模式下也支持？";
"Experimental Features: When splitting a pane, use the profile with local modifications, not the backing profile." = "实验性功能： 拆分分屏面板时，使用带有本地修改的配置文件，而非底层配置文件。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum capture-time lead, in milliseconds.\nThe host stops sending new frames once it is more than this far ahead of the last frame the phone acknowledged, then resumes when the phone catches up. Larger values tolerate more link latency at the cost of a live view that can lag further behind. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "实验性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 实时流：最大捕获时间领先量（以毫秒为单位）。\n当主机领先手机最后确认的帧超过此值时，主机停止发送新帧，待手机追上后恢复。较大的值能容忍更高的链路延迟，代价是实时视图可能落后更多。仅影响帧率；每帧质量不变。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum phone decode-queue depth.\nThe host stops sending new frames once the phone reports more than this many frames queued for decode/display, then resumes as the queue drains. Larger values let more frames pile up on the phone before backing off. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "实验性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 实时流：最大手机解码队列深度。\n当手机报告排队等待解码/显示的帧超过此值时，主机停止发送新帧，随队列排空而恢复。较大的值允许更多帧在手机上堆积后再退让。仅影响帧率；每帧质量不变。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: video bitrate multiplier.\nScales the resolution-derived encoder bitrate. Values above 1 make streamed text sharper at the cost of bandwidth; values below 1 save bandwidth at the cost of sharpness. The result is still clamped to the stream’s minimum and ceiling bitrates." = "实验性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 实时流：视频比特率倍数。\n缩放基于分辨率导出的编码器比特率。大于 1 的值以带宽为代价使流式文本更清晰；小于 1 的值以清晰度为代价节省带宽。结果仍会被限制在流的最小和最高比特率之间。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy push notifications: minimum seconds between wakeup pushes.\nA wakeup push tells the paired phone to fetch every new message and alert at once, so several in quick succession are wasteful and can leave a later one with nothing to show (the generic “Your agent has an update.” placeholder). The host sends the first wakeup immediately, then coalesces any that follow within this interval into a single trailing wakeup. Lower values notify sooner but coalesce less; higher values coalesce bursts more aggressively." = "实验性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 推送通知：唤醒推送之间的最小间隔秒数。\n唤醒推送通知配对的手机立即获取所有新消息和提醒，因此快速连续发送多次会造成浪费，并可能导致后续推送无可显示内容（通用的「你的代理有更新。」占位符）。主机会立即发送第一次唤醒，然后将此间隔内的后续唤醒合并为一次尾部唤醒。较低的值通知更快但合并较少；较高的值更积极地合并突发推送。";
"Export Failed" = "导出失败";
"Export to File" = "导出到文件";
"Export…" = "导出…";
"Extend Selection" = "扩展选区";
"Failed to copy settings to custom directory." = "复制设置到自定义目录失败。";
"Failed to load settings from URL. Falling back to local copy." = "从 URL 加载设置失败。回退到本地副本。";
"Failed to load settings from custom directory. Falling back to local copy." = "从自定义目录加载设置失败。回退到本地副本。";
"File:" = "文件：";
"Find Again Down" = "向下再次查找";
"Find Again Up" = "向上再次查找";
"Find Regular Expression…" = "查找正则表达式…";
"Focused window" = "当前焦点窗口";
"Force Touch Single Click" = "Force Touch 单击";
"Function Call" = "函数调用";
"Function calling" = "函数调用";
"Function key behavior: Regular, Hyper, Meta, or Super" = "功能键行为：Regular、Hyper、Meta 或 Super";
"Gemini" = "Gemini";
"General" = "通用";
"General: $PATH used when running git for the status bar component.\nChange this to use a custom install of git. You must restart iTerm2 for a change here to take effect." = "通用： 状态栏组件运行 git 时使用的 $PATH。\n更改此项可使用自定义安装的 git。更改此处后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: 1Password account name.\nThis is used if you’ve enabled the 1Password integration in the password manager. Use `op account list` to get the list of accounts. This can be an account shorthand, sign-in address, account ID, or user ID." = "通用： 1Password 账户名称。\n如果您在密码管理器中启用了 1Password 集成，则使用此项。使用 `op account list` 获取账户列表。这可以是账户简写、登录地址、账户 ID 或用户 ID。";
"General: Add a 'Dynamic' tag to dynamic profiles.\nWhen enabled, dynamic profiles will have a 'Dynamic' tag added to them, which can be used to filter or identify them." = "通用： 为动态配置文件添加“Dynamic”标签。\n启用后，动态配置文件将添加“Dynamic”标签，可用于过滤或识别它们。";
"General: Add status bar icon when excluded from dock?\nWhen you turn on “Exclude from Dock and ⌘-Tab Application Switcher” a status bar icon is added to the menu bar so you can switch the setting back off. Disable this to remove the status bar icon. Doing so makes it very hard to get to Settings. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "通用： 从程序坞中排除时添加状态栏图标？\n当您打开“从程序坞和 ⌘-Tab 应用切换器中排除”时，会在菜单栏中添加状态栏图标以便您将该设置重新关闭。禁用此项可移除状态栏图标。这样做会使进入设置变得非常困难。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2。";
"General: Allow pairing a companion iOS device?\nOff by default while this feature is in development. When off, the Companion Device Settings menu item is hidden. Managed environments can also use this to disable the feature. The user defaults key is `CompanionPairingAllowed`." = "通用： 允许配对 iOS 伴侣设备？\n此功能开发期间默认关闭。关闭时，「伴侣设备设置」菜单项被隐藏。受管环境也可用此项禁用该功能。用户默认键为 `CompanionPairingAllowed`。";
"General: Allow the standard system menu on window Zoom buttons to open?\nmacOS has a bug that makes the app hang. Since this is a rarely used menu, it is disabled by default." = "通用： 允许窗口缩放按钮上的标准系统菜单打开？\nmacOS 存在一个会使应用卡住的错误。由于此菜单很少使用，因此默认禁用。";
"General: Allow the use of large language model APIs?\nThe purpose of this setting is to make it easy for managed environments to disable the use of LLMs. The user defaults key is `GenerativeAIAllowed`." = "通用： 允许使用大语言模型 API？\n此设置的目的是让受管环境易于禁用 LLM。用户默认键为 `GenerativeAIAllowed`。";
"General: Bundle ID of browser to open URLs with.\nLeave empty to use system default." = "通用： 用于打开 URL 的浏览器 Bundle ID。\n留空以使用系统默认值。";
"General: Buttons in modal alerts indicate keyboard shortcuts.\nDo you miss Windows 95? I do." = "通用： 模态警告中的按钮指示键盘快捷键。\n您怀念 Windows 95 吗？我怀念。";
"General: Comma-separated list of LastPass groups for the password manager to look in for passwords." = "通用： 密码管理器在其中查找密码的 LastPass 组的逗号分隔列表。";
"General: Command to view man pages.\nUsed when you press the man page button on the touch bar. %@ is replaced with the command. End the command with & to avoid opening an iTerm2 window (e.g., if you're launching an external viewer)." = "通用： 查看 man 页面的命令。\n在您按下触控栏上的 man 页面按钮时使用。%@ 替换为命令。以 & 结尾命令可避免打开 iTerm2 窗口（例如启动外部查看器时）。";
"General: Delay after changing number of screens/resolution until refresh (seconds).\nThis works around OS bugs where it takes some time after a screen change before it is safe to resize windows." = "通用： 屏幕数量/分辨率更改后到刷新前的延迟（秒）。\n这用于绕过屏幕更改后需要一段时间才能安全调整窗口大小的操作系统错误。";
"General: Delay between detecting a change to dynamic profiles and acting on it.\nIf a lot of changes happen to the DynamicProfiles folder a longer delay will help coalesce filesystem events to reduce CPU usage." = "通用： 检测到动态配置文件更改与执行操作之间的延迟。\n如果 DynamicProfiles 文件夹发生大量更改，较长的延迟有助于合并文件系统事件以降低 CPU 使用率。";
"General: Disable App Nap.\nChange effective after restarting iTerm2." = "通用： 禁用 App Nap。\n重启 iTerm2 后生效。";
"General: Disable DECRQCRA?\nThis control sequence allows an app running in the terminal to read its contents." = "通用： 禁用 DECRQCRA？\n此控制序列允许在终端中运行的应用读取其内容。";
"General: Disable potentially insecure escape sequences.\nSome features of iTerm2 expand the surface area for security issues. Consider turning this on when viewing untrusted content. The following custom escape sequences will be disabled: RemoteHost, StealFocus, CurrentDir, SetProfile, CopyToClipboard, EndCopy, File, SetBackgroundImageFile, OSC 6’s proxy icon-changing feature. The following DEC sequences are disabled: DECRQCRA. The following xterm extensions are disabled: Window Title Reporting, Icon Title Reporting. This will break displaying inline images, file download, some shell integration features, and other features." = "通用： 禁用潜在不安全的转义序列。\niTerm2 的某些功能扩大了安全问题的攻击面。在查看不受信任的内容时考虑启用此项。以下自定义转义序列将被禁用：RemoteHost、StealFocus、CurrentDir、SetProfile、CopyToClipboard、EndCopy、File、SetBackgroundImageFile、OSC 6 的代理图标更改功能。以下 DEC 序列被禁用：DECRQCRA。以下 xterm 扩展被禁用：窗口标题报告、图标标题报告。这将破坏内联图像显示、文件下载、某些 shell 集成功能及其他功能。";
"General: Disable remapping modifiers for system shortcuts.\nThis prevents asking for accessibility permission. It breaks remapping system shortcuts like cmd-tab." = "通用： 禁用系统快捷键的修饰键重映射。\n这可避免请求辅助功能权限。它会破坏 cmd-tab 等系统快捷键的重映射。";
"General: Downloads folder.\nIf set, downloaded files go to this location instead of the user’s $HOME/Downloads folder." = "通用： 下载文件夹。\n如果设置，下载的文件将转到此位置而非用户的 $HOME/Downloads 文件夹。";
"General: Dry-run “Erase All Settings and Data”.\nWhen enabled, the Erase All Settings and Data button logs what it would delete (via NSLog) instead of actually deleting anything, and does not quit. Intended for testing the feature." = "通用： 试运行“擦除所有设置和数据”。\n启用后，“擦除所有设置和数据”按钮会通过 NSLog 记录将要删除的内容而非实际删除任何内容，并且不会退出。用于测试此功能。";
"General: Exclude utun interfaces from network utilization?\nThis is useful if you use a VPN and only want to see the traffic that goes over Wi-Fi or Ethernet." = "通用： 从网络利用率中排除 utun 接口？\n如果您使用 VPN 且只想查看通过 Wi-Fi 或以太网的流量，此功能很有用。";
"General: Folder for config files. There must not be a space in the path.\nIf empty, then ~/.config/iterm2 will be the default location." = "通用： 配置文件的文件夹。路径中不得包含空格。\n如果为空，则 ~/.config/iterm2 将作为默认位置。";
"General: Folder where the “Save” button in the screenshot window writes files.\nLeave empty to save to the Desktop. The “Save As…” button ignores this and always prompts for a location." = "通用： 截图窗口中“保存”按钮写入文件的文件夹。\n留空以保存到桌面。“另存为…”按钮忽略此项并始终提示选择位置。";
"General: Grace period for automatic quitting after the last window is closed.\nIf iTerm2 is configured to quit automatically when the last window is closed, this setting gives a grace period (in seconds) after startup where that feature is disabled. Set to 0 to have no grace period." = "通用： 关闭最后一个窗口后自动退出的宽限期。\n如果 iTerm2 配置为在最后一个窗口关闭时自动退出，此设置指定启动后该功能被禁用的宽限期（秒）。设为 0 表示无宽限期。";
"General: Height of the status bar in points.\nThis will also affect the height of per-pane title bars becuase the status bar may be embedded in it. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "通用： 状态栏的高度（点）。\n这也会影响每个分屏面板标题栏的高度，因为状态栏可能嵌入其中。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Hide stuck tooltips.\nWhen you hide iTerm2 using a hotkey while a tooltip is fading out it gets stuck because of an OS bug. Work around it with a nasty hack by enabling this feature." = "通用： 隐藏卡住的工具提示。\n当您使用热键隐藏 iTerm2 时，若工具提示正在淡出，由于操作系统错误它会卡住。启用此功能可通过一个棘手的变通方法解决此问题。";
"General: Hotkey windows are excluded from Cycle Through Windows." = "通用： 热键窗口被排除在“循环切换窗口”之外。";
"General: How long to wait for the emoji panel to open in seconds?\nFloating hotkey windows adjust their level when the emoji panel is open. If it’s really slow you might need to increase this value to prevent it from appearing beneath a floating hotkey window." = "通用： 等待表情面板打开的时长（秒）？\n浮动热键窗口会在表情面板打开时调整其层级。如果速度很慢，您可能需要增大此值以防止它出现在浮动热键窗口下方。";
"General: Indicate the number of bells rung while the app is inactive in the dock icon’s badge label" = "通用： 在程序坞图标的徽章标签中指示应用处于非活动状态时响铃的次数。";
"General: LLM Platform.\nLegal values are: OpenAI, Azure, Gemini. This determines the format of requests and responses." = "通用： LLM 平台。\n合法值为：OpenAI、Azure、Gemini。这决定请求和响应的格式。";
"General: Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Python API.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "通用： 提供给 Python API 的选区最大字节数。\n此处设置较大值可能会在选区很大时导致性能问题。";
"General: Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Services.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "通用： 提供给服务的选区最大字节数。\n此处设置较大值可能会在选区很大时导致性能问题。";
"General: Maximum number of characters before and after the click location to search when applying word selection regex patterns." = "通用： 应用单词选择正则表达式模式时，在点击位置前后搜索的最大字符数。";
"General: Maximum number of lines before and after the click location to include in smart selection." = "通用： 智能选择中包含点击位置前后的最大行数。";
"General: Maximum number of trigger-launched commands that can run at once.\nIf too many “Run Command…” triggers fire their commands will be queued. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "通用： 可同时运行的最大触发器启动命令数。\n如果过多的“运行命令…”触发器触发，其命令将排队。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Maximum pixel height for a single screenshot file.\nScreenshots taller than this will be split into multiple files. Also affects the maximum total pixels (this value squared / 5)." = "通用： 单个截图文件的最大像素高度。\n高于此高度的截图将被拆分为多个文件。也影响最大总像素数（此值的平方 / 5）。";
"General: Number of autocomplete options to present.\nA value less than 100 is recommended." = "通用： 要呈现的自动补全选项数量。\n建议使用小于 100 的值。";
"General: Omit session identifier from notifications.\nWhen enabled, notifications will only show the message without the session name and tab number prefix." = "通用： 从通知中省略会话标识符。\n启用后，通知将仅显示消息而不显示会话名称和标签页编号前缀。";
"General: Open a new window when you click the dock icon and no windows are already open, and also on app launch when no other windows are open?" = "通用： 当没有窗口已打开时点击程序坞图标是否打开新窗口，以及在应用启动时没有其他窗口打开时是否也打开？";
"General: Open a window at startup?\nThis is useful if you wish to use the system window restoration settings but not create a new window if none would be restored." = "通用： 启动时打开窗口？\n如果您希望使用系统窗口恢复设置但在不会恢复任何窗口时不创建新窗口，此设置很有用。";
"General: Path to folder with dynamic profiles.\nWhen empty, ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles will be used. You must restart iTerm2 after modifying this setting." = "通用： 动态配置文件文件夹的路径。\n为空时，将使用 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles。修改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2。";
"General: Path to ftp for opening ftp: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/ftp to use the Homebrew install." = "通用： 用于打开 ftp： URL 的 ftp 路径。\n您可能需要将其设为 /usr/local/bin/ftp 以使用 Homebrew 安装版本。";
"General: Path to telnet for opening telnet: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/telnet to use the Homebrew install." = "通用： 用于打开 telnet： URL 的 telnet 路径。\n您可能需要将其设为 /usr/local/bin/telnet 以使用 Homebrew 安装版本。";
"General: Perform dictionary lookups on force press.\nIf this is NO, force press will still preview the Semantic History action; only dictionary lookups can be disabled." = "通用： 在重按时执行词典查找。\n如果为“否”，重按仍会预览语义历史操作；只有词典查找可被禁用。";
"General: Perform restorable state integrity checks?" = "通用： 执行可恢复状态完整性检查？";
"General: Pin Edit Session window to the session it originally edited.\nIf not set, it will affect the most recently active session." = "通用： 将“编辑会话”窗口固定到最初编辑的会话。\n如果未设置，它将影响最近活动的会话。";
"General: Rate limit for Alert triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "通用： 警告触发器的速率限制。\n如果同一触发器触发的时间间隔（秒）小于此值，则会被抑制。";
"General: Rate limit for Notification triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "通用： 通知触发器的速率限制。\n如果同一触发器触发的时间间隔（秒）小于此值，则会被抑制。";
"General: Redraw the screen after the Clear Buffer menu item is selected.\nWhen enabled, the TTY size is briefly changed after clearing the buffer to cause the shell or current app to redraw." = "通用： 选择“清除缓冲区”菜单项后重绘屏幕。\n启用后，清除缓冲区后会短暂更改 TTY 大小以使 shell 或当前应用重绘。";
"General: Relay origin for companion iOS device pairing.\nMust be a bare https origin (scheme and host, no path), such as https://companion-relay.iterm2.com. The relay is the only transport, so this must be set for pairing to work; forks can point it at their own Worker. Leave empty to disable the relay entirely. The user defaults key is `CompanionRelayOrigin`." = "通用： iOS 伴侣设备配对的中继源。\n必须是纯 https 源（协议和主机，无路径），如 https：//companion-relay.iterm2.com。中继是唯一的传输方式，因此必须设置此项配对才能工作；分支版本可指向自己的 Worker。留空则完全禁用中继。用户默认键为 `CompanionRelayOrigin`。";
"General: Reveal file created by “Export All Settings and Data” in finder upon completion" = "通用： 完成后在 Finder 中显示由“导出所有设置和数据”创建的文件。";
"General: Save scroll buffer when clearing screen.\nWhen enabled, saves the current screen into scroll back buffer instead of clearing it." = "通用： 清除屏幕时保存滚动缓冲区。\n启用后，将当前屏幕保存到回滚缓冲区而非清除它。";
"General: Save the screen to scrollback when an app moves the cursor above the prompt.\nSome full-screen programs that don’t use the alternate screen buffer repaint by moving the cursor to the top of the screen and overwriting whatever was already there, destroying content you can still see. When enabled, iTerm2 first scrolls the visible screen into history so that content isn’t lost. Requires shell integration." = "通用： 当应用将光标移到提示符上方时将屏幕保存到回滚。\n某些不使用备用屏幕缓冲区的全屏程序通过将光标移到屏幕顶部并覆盖已有内容来重绘，从而破坏您仍可见的内容。启用后，iTerm2 会先将可见屏幕滚动到历史记录中以避免内容丢失。需要 shell 集成。";
"General: Shard-map URL for companion iOS device pairing.\nAn https URL pointing directly at the static shard-map JSON, used to find the relay shard that serves the phone-to-mac connection. It is fetched verbatim (nothing is appended). Leave empty to use direct connections (such as if you run your own relay)." = "通用： iOS 伴侣设备配对的分片映射 URL。\n指向静态分片映射 JSON 的 https URL，用于查找服务于手机到 Mac 连接的中继分片。原样获取（不追加任何内容）。留空则使用直接连接（例如你运行自己的中继）。";
"General: Should opening a script with iTerm2 disable the default profile's “Send Text at Start” setting?\nIf you use “open iTerm2 file.command” or drag a script onto iTerm2's icon and this setting is enabled then the script will be executed in lieu of the profile's “Send Text at Start” setting. If this setting is off then both will be executed." = "通用： 使用 iTerm2 打开脚本时是否禁用默认配置文件的“启动时发送文本”设置？\n如果您使用“open iTerm2 file.command”或将脚本拖到 iTerm2 图标上且此设置已启用，则将执行脚本而非配置文件的“启动时发送文本”设置。如果此设置关闭，则两者都会执行。";
"General: Should split pane navigation by direction wrap around?" = "通用： 按方向导航分屏面板是否循环？";
"General: Show buttons at the top of a selected command?\nWhen you select a command by single clicking the command line or its output, buttons are shown on the top right with options like Copy and Share. Note that this setting only applies when marks are not “line style” such as when using Auto Composer." = "通用： 在选中命令的顶部显示按钮？\n当您通过单击命令行或其输出来选择命令时，右上角会显示带有“复制”和“分享”等选项的按钮。请注意，此设置仅在标记非“线条样式”时适用，例如使用 Auto Composer 时。";
"General: Show hints in split pane menu items to indicate horizontal vs vertical semantics.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "通用： 在分屏面板菜单项中显示提示以指示水平与垂直语义。\n更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Suppress confirmation of terminal-initiated downloads?" = "通用： 抑制终端发起下载的确认？";
"General: Swap Find Next and Find Previous.\nIf enabled, Find Next will search up and Find Previous will search down (iTerm2's traditional behavior, which is a departure from macOS's standard). When disabled, search behaves like a normal macOS app." = "通用： 交换“查找下一个”和“查找上一个”。\n启用后，“查找下一个”将向上搜索，“查找上一个”将向下搜索（iTerm2 的传统行为，偏离 macOS 标准）。禁用后，搜索行为与普通 macOS 应用相同。";
"General: Synchronize search queries across windows and applications.\nNormally, when you enter a search query in a Find field all find fields in all applications get updated to hold the same value. This is utter nonsense, and can be disabled by setting this preference to No." = "通用： 跨窗口和应用同步搜索查询。\n通常，当您在查找字段中输入搜索查询时，所有应用中的所有查找字段都会更新为相同值。这完全没有意义，可通过将此偏好设为“否”来禁用。";
"General: System notifications should be silent." = "通用： 系统通知应为静默。";
"General: Template for URL of search engine.\niTerm2 replaces the string “%@” with the text to search for. Query parameter percent escaping is used." = "通用： 搜索引擎 URL 的模板。\niTerm2 会将字符串“%@”替换为要搜索的文本。使用查询参数百分号转义。";
"General: Template of URL for typeahead search suggestions.\niTerm replaces the string “%@” with the text to search for. Query parameter percent escaping is used." = "通用： 预输入搜索建议 URL 的模板。\niTerm 会将字符串“%@”替换为要搜索的文本。使用查询参数百分号转义。";
"General: Time in seconds before a session is considered idle.\nUsed for updating icons and activity indicator in tabs." = "通用： 会话被视为空闲前的时间（秒）。\n用于更新标签页中的图标和活动指示器。";
"General: Time to wait before performing Find action on 1- or 2- character queries." = "通用： 对 1 或 2 个字符的查询执行查找操作前等待的时间。";
"General: Time to wait before showing tips in the main menu.\nSet this to a big number if you don’t like the tips." = "通用： 在主菜单中显示提示前等待的时间。\n如果您不喜欢提示，请将此值设为一个较大的数字。";
"General: Timeout (seconds) for evaluating RPCs.\nThis applies to invoking functions registered by scripts when using the Swift syntax for inline expressions." = "通用： 评估 RPC 的超时时间（秒）。\n这适用于在使用内联表达式的 Swift 语法时调用脚本注册的函数。";
"General: Timeout for downloading settings" = "通用： 下载设置的超时时间。";
"General: Timeout in seconds when running git for the status bar component." = "通用： 状态栏组件运行 git 时的超时时间（秒）。";
"General: Treat the top row of keys like number keys on an English keyboard for the purposes of switching panes, tabs, and windows with modifier+number.\nFor example, AZERTY requires you to hold down Shift to enter a number. To switch tabs with ⌘+Number on an AZERTY keyboard, you must enable this setting. Then, for example, ⌘-& switches to tab 1. When this setting is enabled, some user-defined shortcuts may become unavailable because the tab/window/pane switching behavior takes precedence." = "通用： 为了使用修饰键+数字切换分屏面板、标签页和窗口，将顶行按键视为英文键盘上的数字键。\n例如，AZERTY 键盘需要按住 Shift 才能输入数字。要在 AZERTY 键盘上使用 ⌘+数字切换标签页，必须启用此设置。这样，例如 ⌘-& 可切换到标签页 1。启用此设置后，某些用户自定义快捷键可能不可用，因为标签页/窗口/分屏面板切换行为优先。";
"General: URL to check for updates to the AI model catalog.\nThe catalog defines the built-in AI models (context window, capabilities, and the recommended model per vendor). iTerm2 periodically downloads a signed newer copy so new models become available without an app update. This happens only when AI features are enabled and you have granted permission; a non-empty URL by itself does not enable checking. Clearing this URL disables checking entirely." = "通用： 用于检查 AI 模型目录更新的 URL。\n该目录定义了内置 AI 模型（上下文窗口、功能以及每个供应商的推荐模型）。iTerm2 会定期下载签名的较新副本，使新模型无需应用更新即可使用。这仅在启用 AI 功能且你已授权时才会发生；仅 URL 非空不会启用检查。清除此 URL 将完全禁用检查。";
"General: Use Open Directory to determine the user shell" = "通用： 使用 Open Directory 确定用户 shell。";
"General: Use old-style find and paste progress indicator views.\nThis change will only affect new windows." = "通用： 使用旧式查找和粘贴进度指示器视图。\n此更改仅影响新窗口。";
"General: User agent for web views. Leave empty to use system default." = "通用： Web 视图的用户代理。留空以使用系统默认值。";
"General: Value to set LC_CTYPE to if the machine‘s combination of country and language are not supported.\nIf unset, the encoding (e.g., UTF-8) will be used." = "通用： 当机器的国家和语言组合不受支持时要将 LC_CTYPE 设置为的值。\n如果未设置，将使用编码（例如 UTF-8）。";
"General: When sorting command history for auto command completion: how much should number of uses of a command contribute to its score? A higher score moves the command closer to the top of the list.\nUse 0 to ignore number of uses." = "通用： 对命令历史进行排序以用于自动命令补全时：命令使用次数对其得分的贡献程度？得分越高命令越靠近列表顶部。\n设为 0 可忽略使用次数。";
"General: When sorting command history for auto command completion: how much should the time-since-last-use of a command contribute to its score? A higher score moves the command closer to the top of the list.\nUse 0 to ignore time since last use." = "通用： 对命令历史进行排序以用于自动命令补全时：命令距上次使用的时间对其得分的贡献程度？得分越高命令越靠近列表顶部。\n设为 0 可忽略距上次使用的时间。";
