"Hotkey: Duration in seconds of the hotkey window animation.\nWarning: reducing this value may cause problems if you have multiple displays." = "热键： 热键窗口动画的时长（秒）。\n警告：如果您有多个显示器，减小此值可能会导致问题。";
"Hotkey: If the only window is a hotkey window, then clicking the dock icon shows or hides it." = "热键： 如果唯一的窗口是热键窗口，则点击程序坞图标会显示或隐藏它。";
"Hotkey: Show indicator for pinned hotkey windows." = "热键： 为固定的热键窗口显示指示器。";
"Hotkey: The hotkey window floats above other windows even when another application is active.\nYou must disable “Settings > Keys > Hotkey window hides when focus is lost” for this setting to be effective." = "热键： 即使其他应用处于活动状态，热键窗口也浮于其他窗口之上。\n您必须禁用“设置 > 按键 > 热键窗口失去焦点时隐藏”此设置才能生效。";
"Hotkey: The maximum amount of time allowed between presses of a modifier key when performing a modifier double-tap." = "热键： 执行修饰键双击时两次按下修饰键之间允许的最大时间间隔。";
"Hotkey: The minimum amount of time required between presses of a modifier key when performing a modifier double-tap." = "热键： 执行修饰键双击时两次按下修饰键之间所需的最小时间间隔。";
