"Mouse: Always accept first mouse event on terminal windows.\nThis means clicks will work the same when iTerm2 is active as when it’s inactive. Note that there is a separate setting for mouse reporting on first mouse." = "鼠标： 始终接受终端窗口的首次鼠标事件。\n这意味着 iTerm2 处于非活动状态时点击与处于活动状态时效果相同。请注意，首次鼠标的鼠标报告有单独的设置。";
"Mouse: Automatically detect when mouse reporting got stuck on?\nThis watches for parts of mouse reporting control sequences being printed to the screen" = "鼠标： 自动检测鼠标报告是否卡在开启状态？\n此功能会监视打印到屏幕上的鼠标报告控制序列片段。";
"Mouse: Disable changing font size in response to a pinch gesture." = "鼠标： 禁用响应捏合手势更改字体大小。";
"Mouse: Double-report scroll wheel events to work around tmux scrolling bug." = "鼠标： 重复报告滚轮事件以绕过 tmux 滚动错误。";
"Mouse: Fraction of character’s width on its right side that can be used to select the character to its right." = "鼠标： 字符右侧宽度中可用于选择其右侧字符的比例。";
"Mouse: Horizontal scrolling is reversed when “Natural scrolling” is enabled in System Settings" = "鼠标： 当在“系统设置”中启用“自然滚动”时反转水平滚动方向。";
"Mouse: Require Option to be pressed to drag a split pane by its title bar?\nThis helps prevent accidental drags." = "鼠标： 需要按住 Option 才能通过标题栏拖动分屏面板？\n这有助于防止意外拖动。";
"Mouse: Scroll on any scroll wheel movement, no matter how small?" = "鼠标： 任何滚轮移动都进行滚动，无论多么微小？";
"Mouse: Scroll wheel sends arrow keys when in alternate screen mode." = "鼠标： 在备用屏幕模式下滚动滚轮发送方向键。";
"Mouse: Send mouse reports when you click in a window that isn't already frontmouse?" = "鼠标： 在点击非前置窗口时发送鼠标报告？";
"Mouse: Sensitivity of mouse wheel for horizontal scrolling.\nUse 0 to disable. Value should be between 0 and 1. Changes to this setting only affect new sessions." = "鼠标： 鼠标滚轮水平滚动的灵敏度。\n设为 0 可禁用。值应在 0 到 1 之间。更改此设置仅影响新会话。";
"Mouse: Speed up scroll gestures by this factor." = "鼠标： 按此倍数加快滚动手势速度。";
"Mouse: Underline Semantic History-selectable items under the cursor while holding ⌘?" = "鼠标： 按住 ⌘ 时为光标下可被语义历史选择的项添加下划线？";
"Mouse: Use system cursor icons when possible." = "鼠标： 尽可能使用系统光标图标。";
"Mouse: Wait to be sure it's not a double click before selecting a command" = "鼠标： 在确认为非双击后再选择命令。";
"Mouse: When Focus Follows Mouse is enabled, activate the window under the cursor when iTerm2 becomes active?" = "鼠标： 当启用“焦点跟随鼠标”时，iTerm2 变为活动状态时是否激活光标下的窗口？";
"Mouse: When Focus Follows Mouse is enabled, steal key focus even when inactive." = "鼠标： 当启用“焦点跟随鼠标”时，即使处于非活动状态也抢占键盘焦点。";
"Mouse: ⌘-click in an active pane while iTerm2 isn't the active app invokes Semantic History.\nBy default, iTerm2 respects the OS standard that ⌘-click in an app that doesn't have keyboard focus behaves like a non-⌘ click that does not raise the window." = "鼠标： 当 iTerm2 不是活动应用时，在活动分屏面板中按住 ⌘ 点击会调用语义历史。\n默认情况下，iTerm2 遵循操作系统标准：在没有键盘焦点的应用中按 ⌘ 点击的行为类似于不带 ⌘ 的点击，不会激活窗口。";
"Mouse: ⌘-click in the prompt shows the Command Info window" = "鼠标： 在提示符处按 ⌘ 点击显示“命令信息”窗口。";
