"SSH Integration: Command used to set the `uname` variable.\nThe main use of this is to use in the AI prompt so the language model knows the operating system." = "SSH 集成： 用于设置 `uname` 变量的命令。\n主要用途是在 AI 提示词中使用，让语言模型了解操作系统。";
"SSH Integration: Valid characters in SSH user names\nAlphanumerics are always valid. This specifies other valid characters." = "SSH 集成： SSH 用户名中的有效字符\n字母数字始终有效。此项指定其他有效字符。";
