"Scripting: Set IT2_APP_PATH environment variable on new sessions, pointing at this iTerm2 build’s app bundle?\nThis disambiguates the AppleScript target when multiple iTerm2 builds with the same bundle identifier are running, so that the “it2” CLI requests its cookie from this iTerm2 instance. Intended for iTerm2 developers. Only affects sessions created after changing this setting." = "脚本： 在新会话上设置 IT2_APP_PATH 环境变量，指向此 iTerm2 构建版本的 app bundle？\n当具有相同 bundle identifier 的多个 iTerm2 构建版本同时运行时，这可消除 AppleScript 目标的歧义，使「it2」CLI 向此 iTerm2 实例请求其 cookie。面向 iTerm2 开发者。仅影响更改此设置后创建的会话。";
"Scripting: Set ITERM2_COOKIE environment variable, allowing Python scripts to be launched without confirmation?\nThis will only affect sessions created after changing this setting." = "脚本： 设置 ITERM2_COOKIE 环境变量，允许无需确认即启动 Python 脚本？\n这仅影响更改此设置后创建的会话。";
"Scripting: Should references to undefined variables in interpolated strings be converted to empty string?\nWhen enabled, an expression in an interpolated string that references an undefined variable will be treated as an empty string. For example, “\\(bogus)”. References to undefined variables as arguments to function calls, such as “\\(f(bogus))”, are still errors." = "脚本： 插值字符串中对未定义变量的引用是否应转换为空字符串？\n启用时，插值字符串中引用未定义变量的表达式将被视为空字符串。例如「\\(bogus)」。作为函数调用参数的未定义变量引用（如「\\(f(bogus))」）仍为错误。";
"Scripting: URL of the uv download manifest (used when the Python runtime is provisioned with uv)." = "脚本： uv 下载清单的 URL（在使用 uv 配备 Python 运行时时使用）。";
"Scripting: URL to check for new Beta versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "脚本： 用于检查 Python 脚本运行时新 Beta 版本的 URL。";
"Scripting: URL to check for new versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "脚本： 用于检查 Python 脚本运行时新版本的 URL。";
"Scripting: Use uv to provision the Python runtime for API scripts?\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 uses uv to download Python and build per-script environments instead of the bundled Python runtime. Scripts already provisioned continue to run regardless of this setting; it only affects creating, importing, and migrating scripts." = "脚本： 使用 uv 为 API 脚本配备 Python 运行时？\n启用时，iTerm2 使用 uv 下载 Python 并为每个脚本构建环境，而非使用内置的 Python 运行时。已配备的脚本无论此设置如何都继续运行；它仅影响脚本的创建、导入和迁移。";
