"Semantic History: Characters never considered part of a URL.\nThe characters in this string may never occur in a URL; when one is seen that delineates the beginning or end of a URL." = "语义历史： 绝不视为 URL 一部分的字符。\n此字符串中的字符不得出现在 URL 中；当遇到其中一个时，即界定 URL 的起始或结束。";
"Semantic History: Characters to ignore at the end of a URL" = "语义历史： URL 结尾要忽略的字符。";
"Semantic History: Check smart selection actions before existing files on cmd-click?" = "语义历史： 在 cmd-点击时，先检查智能选区操作再检查现有文件？";
"Semantic History: Command to run when opening a clicked URL, instead of asking the OS to open it.\nWhen non-empty, this command runs as a silent background task via /bin/sh -c whenever you click a URL (including OSC 8 hyperlinks and auto-detected URLs) that iTerm2 would otherwise hand to the system. This is an interpolated string; use \\(url) for the URL and \\(background) for whether a background open was requested (1 if you held option while clicking, otherwise 0). The command is responsible for opening the URL however it likes (e.g., “open -g \\(url)” to open in the background). When empty, URLs open normally. iTerm2-internal schemes (iterm2:), URL schemes bound to a profile, and Semantic History file links are not affected." = "语义历史： 点击 URL 时运行的命令，而不是请求系统打开它。\n非空时，每当点击 iTerm2 本应交给系统处理的 URL（包括 OSC 8 超链接和自动检测到的 URL），该命令会通过 /bin/sh -c 作为静默后台任务运行。这是一个插值字符串；用 \\(url) 表示 URL，用 \\(background) 表示是否请求了后台打开（按住 option 点击时为 1，否则为 0）。命令自行负责以任何方式打开 URL（例如「open -g \\(url)」可在后台打开）。为空时，URL 正常打开。iTerm2 内部方案（iterm2：）、绑定到配置文件的 URL 方案以及语义历史文件链接不受影响。";
"Semantic History: Default URL scheme.\nThis is applied to hostnames that are not a single word." = "语义历史： 默认 URL 方案。\n应用于非单个单词的主机名。";
"Semantic History: Disable performing the first matching Smart Selection’s Action on cmd-click?" = "语义历史： 在 cmd-点击时禁用执行第一个匹配的智能选区操作？";
"Semantic History: Enable semantic history for network-mounted filesystems?\nOnly enable this if you know your network-mounted filesystems are really fast and reliable. A slow filesystem may cause the entire iTerm2 app to hang." = "语义历史： 为网络挂载的文件系统启用语义历史？\n仅在你的网络挂载文件系统确实快速且可靠时才启用。缓慢的文件系统可能导致整个 iTerm2 应用卡死。";
"Semantic History: Ignore hard newlines for the purposes of locating URLs and file names for Semantic History.\nIf a hard newline occurs at the end of a line then ⌘-click will not see it all unless this setting is turned on. This is useful for some interactive applications. Turning this on will remove newlines from the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "语义历史： 为语义历史定位 URL 和文件名时忽略硬换行。\n如果硬换行出现在行尾，除非启用此设置，否则按 ⌘ 点击将无法看到全部内容。这对某些交互式应用很有用。启用后会从 \\3 和 \\4 替换中移除换行符。";
"Semantic History: Maximum number of bytes of text before and after click location to take into account.\nThis also limits the size of the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "语义历史： 点击位置前后纳入考量的文本最大字节数。\n这也限制 \\3 和 \\4 替换的大小。";
"Semantic History: Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a URL or file name for Semantic History.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a URL begins and ends. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "语义历史： 被视为语义历史 URL 或文件名一部分的非字母数字字符。\n字母和数字始终被视为 URL 的一部分。这些非字母数字字符额外用于确定 URL 的起始和结束位置。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Semantic History: Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a filename. Note that URL characters (a separate advanced setting) are also allowed.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a file begins and ends. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "语义历史： 被视为文件名一部分的非字母数字字符。请注意，URL 字符（单独的高级设置）也被允许。\n字母和数字始终被视为 URL 的一部分。这些非字母数字字符额外用于确定文件的起始和结束位置。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Semantic History: Only consider a two+ part domain-name to be a URL if it also contains a slash.\nThis setting is used when guessing if a string is a URL for semantic history. When enabled, `example.com` would not be considered a URL but `example.com/` would be." = "语义历史： 仅当两部分及以上域名还包含斜杠时才将其视为 URL。\n此设置用于猜测字符串是否为语义历史 URL。启用后，`example.com` 不会被当作 URL，但 `example.com/` 会被当作 URL。";
"Semantic History: Paths to ignore for Semantic History.\nSeparate paths with a comma. Any file under one of these paths will not be openable with Semantic History. It is wise to add network file systems to this list, since they can be very slow." = "语义历史： 语义历史要忽略的路径。\n以逗号分隔路径。这些路径下的任何文件都无法用语义历史打开。建议将网络文件系统添加到此列表，因为它们可能非常慢。";
"Semantic History: Respect soft boundaries for computing the prefix and suffix text passed to semantic history commands?\nDue to a long-standing bug this did not used to be respected. Soft boundaries were always respected for deciding what text was clicked on, but the prefix and suffix did not. If you have a semantic history command that depends on the bug, you can switch this off to get the pre-3.1.2 behavior." = "语义历史： 在计算传递给语义历史命令的前缀和后缀文本时，是否遵循软边界？\n由于一个长期存在的 bug，过去并未遵循此设置。在判断点击了哪个文本时始终会遵循软边界，但前缀和后缀不会。如果你的语义历史命令依赖于该 bug，可以关闭此项以获得 3.1.2 之前的行为。";
"Semantic History: URLs must contain a scheme?\nEnable this to reduce the number of false positives that semantic history thinks are a URL" = "语义历史： URL 必须包含方案？\n启用此项可减少语义历史误判为 URL 的假阳性数量。";
"Semantic History: Use a yellow for a Shell Integration prompt mark when the job is stopped by a signal." = "语义历史： 当作业被信号停止时，Shell 集成提示标记使用黄色。";
"Send Escape Sequence…" = "发送转义序列…";
"Send Hex Code…" = "发送十六进制代码…";
"Send Text…" = "发送文本…";
"Send text…" = "发送文本…";
"Session: Allow sessions to survive logging out and back in.\nThis breaks the “auth sufficient pam_tid.so” hack some people use to allow sudo to authenticate with Touch ID." = "会话： 允许会话在注销并重新登录后继续存活。\n这会破坏一些人用来让 sudo 通过 Touch ID 认证的「auth sufficient pam_tid.so」 hack。";
"Session: Auto-lock session name after editing it." = "会话： 编辑会话名称后自动锁定。";
"Session: Automatic session logging appends to existing files.\nWhen set to No, the file will be overwritten instead." = "会话： 自动会话日志追加到现有文件。\n设为「否」时，将改为覆盖文件。";
"Session: Character to use for divider lines in session end messages. Leave empty to use secure default (BrokenPipeDivider image). Examples: ━ ─ ═ ╌ ┄" = "会话： 会话结束消息中分隔线使用的字符。留空则使用安全默认值（BrokenPipeDivider 图像）。示例：━ ─ ═ ╌ ┄";
"Session: Enable session restoration.\nSession restoration runs jobs in separate processes. They will survive crashes, force quits, and upgrades.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect." = "会话： 启用会话恢复。\n会话恢复在独立进程中运行作业。它们将在崩溃、强制退出和升级后继续存活。\n你必须重启 iTerm2 此更改才会生效。";
"Session: Format for automatic session log filenames.\nSee the Badges documentation for supported substitutions." = "会话： 自动会话日志文件名的格式。\n有关支持的替换变量，请参阅徽章文档。";
"Session: Format for log timestamps. See Unicode TR 35-31 for syntax.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "会话： 日志时间戳的格式。语法请参见 Unicode TR 35-31。\n你必须重启 iTerm2 此设置的更改才会生效。";
"Session: Hex codes to send to clear the command line when entering the composer.\n0x15 is ^U, 0x0b is ^K." = "会话： 进入编辑器时发送以清空命令行的十六进制代码。\n0x15 为 ^U，0x0b 为 ^K。";
"Session: How long to wait when trying to attach to an iTerm daemon at startup when restoring windows (in seconds)?" = "会话： 启动时恢复窗口并尝试连接 iTerm 守护进程时等待多久（以秒为单位）？";
"Session: Preserve font zoom level when Automatic Profile Switching changes profiles." = "会话： 自动配置文件切换更改配置文件时保留字体缩放级别。";
"Session: Show a “Switched to profile” message when Automatic Profile Switching activates." = "会话： 自动配置文件切换激活时显示「已切换到配置文件」消息。";
"Session: Suppress restart session confirmation alert.\nDon't ask for a confirmation when manually restarting a session." = "会话： 隐藏重启会话确认警告。\n手动重启会话时不询问确认。";
"Session: Suppress the Restart Session offer.\nWhen a session terminates, it will offer to restart itself. Turn this on to suppress the offer permanently." = "会话： 隐藏「重启会话」的提议。\n当会话终止时，它会提议重启自身。开启此项可永久隐藏该提议。";
"Session: Temporarily add a composer to the status bar instead of opening the large composer view when a status bar is present." = "会话： 当状态栏存在时，临时将编辑器添加到状态栏，而不是打开大型编辑器视图。";
"Session: Text displayed when a session ends. Leave empty to use default." = "会话： 会话结束时显示的文本。留空则使用默认值。";
"Session: Text displayed when a session is restarted." = "会话： 会话重启时显示的文本。";
"Session: Text displayed when a short-lived session finishes." = "会话： 短暂会话结束时显示的文本。";
"Session: User-initiated Quit (⌘Q) of iTerm2 will kill all running jobs.\nApplies only when session restoration is on." = "会话： 用户发起的 iTerm2 退出（⌘Q）会终止所有正在运行的作业。\n仅在启用会话恢复时生效。";
"Session: When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for erroneous completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "会话： 当「下次标记时提醒」配置为播放声音时，上一个命令错误完成时使用此名称的文件。\n你可以指定系统声音或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的文件。";
"Session: When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for successful completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "会话： 当「下次标记时提醒」配置为播放声音时，上一个命令成功完成时使用此名称的文件。\n你可以指定系统声音或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的文件。";
"Session: When focus follows mouse is enabled, should new split panes automatically be focused?" = "会话： 启用焦点跟随鼠标时，新拆分的分屏面板是否应自动获得焦点？";
"Session: When logging plain text, include timestamps for each line?" = "会话： 记录纯文本时，是否为每行包含时间戳？";
"Session: When restoring a session without restoring a running job, draw a banner saying “Session Contents Restored” below the restored contents." = "会话： 在不恢复运行中的作业而恢复会话时，在恢复的内容下方绘制一条横幅，显示「会话内容已恢复」。";
"Set job above" = "设置上方的任务";
"Settings" = "设置";
"Settings and your snippets, notes, or icon customizations have changed. Copy them to %@?" = "设置以及您的代码片段、笔记或图标自定义已更改。将它们复制到 %@ 吗？";
"Settings cannot be copied to a URL." = "设置无法复制到 URL。";
"Settings have changed. Copy them to %@?" = "设置已更改。将它们复制到 %@ 吗？";
"Settings: %@" = "设置：%@";
"Shortcuts" = "快捷键";
"Show content regex visualization" = "显示内容正则表达式可视化";
"Show indicators for non-default values" = "显示非默认值的指示标记";
"Show visualization" = "显示可视化";
"Smart Selection" = "智能选择";
"Smart Selection Ignoring Newlines" = "智能选择（忽略换行符）";
"Smart Selection Playground\nEnter text here, then click to see which rule matches at that location." = "智能选区试验场\n在此输入文本，然后点击查看该位置匹配哪条规则。";
"Snippets" = "代码片段";
"Start Instant Replay" = "开始即时回放";
"Streaming responses" = "流式响应";
"String sent in response to ENQ character" = "响应 ENQ 字符时发送的字符串";
"Style of timestamp display" = "时间戳显示样式";
"Subtitle shown below profile name in Open Quickly" = "在“快速打开”中显示在配置文件名称下方的副标题";
"Supports temperature" = "支持温度";
"Swap With Next Pane" = "与下一个分屏面板交换";
"Swap With Previous Pane" = "与上一个分屏面板交换";
"Swap With Split Pane Above" = "与上侧分屏面板交换";
"Swap With Split Pane Below" = "与下侧分屏面板交换";
"Swap With Split Pane on Left" = "与左侧分屏面板交换";
"Swap With Split Pane on Right" = "与右侧分屏面板交换";
"Sync These Too" = "同时同步这些";
"System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable System Settings > General > Close windows when quitting an app to enable window restoration." = "系统窗口恢复已被禁用，这使 iTerm2 无法遵循此设置。禁用系统设置 > 通用 > 退出 App 时关闭窗口以启用窗口恢复。";
"System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable ”System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an application“ to enable window restoration." = "系统窗口恢复已被禁用，这使 iTerm2 无法遵循此设置。禁用”系统设置 > 桌面与程序坞 > 退出 App 时关闭窗口“以启用窗口恢复。";
"Tab Color" = "标签页颜色";
"Tab Color in dark mode" = "标签页颜色（深色模式）";
"Tab Color in light mode" = "标签页颜色（浅色模式）";
"Tabs: Add items to Recents (in the dock icon's menu) to reopen recently used profiles as tabs?" = "标签页： 将项目添加到“最近使用”（程序坞图标菜单中），以标签页形式重新打开最近使用的配置文件？";
"Tabs: Allow a tab to be dragged and dropped outside any existing tab bar to create a new window." = "标签页： 允许将标签页拖放到任何现有标签栏之外以创建新窗口。";
"Tabs: Allow dragging window by the Add Tab button in the tab bar?" = "标签页： 允许通过标签栏中的“新建标签页”按钮拖动窗口？";
"Tabs: Allow two-finger interactive swipe between tabs?\nThe system preference Trackpad > More Gestures > Swipe between pages controls this globally. When “swipe with two fingers” is enabled, you can change this setting to “No” to prevent swiping between tabs in iTerm2." = "标签页： 允许双指在标签页之间交互滑动？\n系统偏好设置“触控板 > 更多手势 > 在页面之间滑动”全局控制此功能。当“用双指滑动”启用时，可将此设置改为“否”以阻止在 iTerm2 中在标签页之间滑动。";
"Tabs: Alpha value for tab color for non-selected colored tabs in the Minimal theme.\nMust be between 0 and 1." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，非选中彩色标签页的标签颜色 alpha 值。\n必须在 0 到 1 之间。";
"Tabs: Animation duration for fade in/out animation of tabs in full screen, in seconds." = "标签页： 全屏下标签页淡入淡出动画的时长（秒）。";
"Tabs: Choosing a profile from the “Profiles” menu opens a new window.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "标签页： 从“配置文件”菜单选择配置文件时会打开新窗口。\n更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target fill when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 拖动分屏面板时放置目标填充的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target inner border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 拖动分屏面板时放置目标内边框的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target outer border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 拖动分屏面板时放置目标外边框的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane fill when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 移动/交换分屏面板时源面板填充的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane inner border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 移动/交换分屏面板时源面板内边框的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane outer border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "标签页： 移动/交换分屏面板时源面板外边框的颜色。\n应为 web 风格颜色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 颜色空间。";
"Tabs: Colors for tab color menu item.\nSpace delimited strings like #rrggbb or #rgb in sRGB color space. If the P3 color space is available, you can use strings like: color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)" = "标签页： 标签页颜色菜单项的颜色。\n以空格分隔的字符串，如 sRGB 颜色空间中的 #rrggbb 或 #rgb。如果 P3 颜色空间可用，可使用如下字符串：color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)。";
"Tabs: Custom tab label font size\nFor this to take effect, turn on “Use custom font size for tab labels?”." = "标签页： 自定义标签页标签字体大小\n要使此设置生效，请打开“为标签页标签使用自定义字体大小？”。";
"Tabs: Default tab bar height\nThis does not affect the minimal or compact themes. On macOS 26 Tahoe-style tabs, the top (horizontal) tab bar uses the system height and ignores this setting; left/right (vertical) tabs use max(26, this value) for each tab’s height." = "标签页： 默认标签栏高度\n此设置不影响 Minimal 或 Compact 主题。在 macOS 26 Tahoe 风格标签页上，顶部（水平）标签栏使用系统高度并忽略此设置；左/右（垂直）标签页使用 max(26， 此值) 作为每个标签页的高度。";
"Tabs: Disable tab bar tooltips?" = "标签页： 禁用标签栏工具提示？";
"Tabs: Draw bottom line for horizontal tabbar in Regular, Dark and Light theme?" = "标签页： 在 Regular、Dark 和 Light 主题中为水平标签栏绘制底线？";
"Tabs: High Contrast modes maximize visibility.\nWhen enabled, the dark high-contrast theme emphasizes visibility over beauty." = "标签页： 高对比度模式可最大化可见性。\n启用后，深色高对比度主题将优先注重可见性而非美观。";
"Tabs: How far must the mouse move before a tab drag is initiated?\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "标签页： 鼠标移动多远后才开始拖动标签页？\n更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Tabs: How long in seconds to show tabs in fullscreen.\nThe tab bar appears briefly in fullscreen when the number of tabs changes or you switch tabs. This setting gives the time in seconds for it to remain visible." = "标签页： 全屏时显示标签页的时长（秒）。\n当标签页数量变化或切换标签页时，标签栏会在全屏下短暂出现。此设置指定其保持可见的时间（秒）。";
"Tabs: How much should contrast be increased for text in tabs in the Minimal theme?\nChoose a value larger than 1 to increase contrast. Values between 0 and 1 have less contrast than the default." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，标签页文字的对比度应增加多少？\n选择大于 1 的值可增加对比度。0 到 1 之间的值对比度低于默认值。";
"Tabs: How prominent should the outline around the selected tab be drawn when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 3, where 0 means no outline and 3 means a very prominent outline." = "标签页： 当窗口中有彩色标签页时，选中标签页周围轮廓的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 3，其中 0 表示无轮廓，3 表示非常突出的轮廓。";
"Tabs: How prominent should the text in a non-selected tab be when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, the alpha value." = "标签页： 当窗口中有彩色标签页时，非选中标签页中文字的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，即 alpha 值。";
"Tabs: Ignore System Settings > Dock > Prefer tabs when opening documents?\nWhen set to No, asking to open a window will open a tab instead when system settings is configured to prefer tabs over windows. When set to Yes, asking to open a window may open a tab instead." = "标签页： 忽略“系统设置 > 程序坞 > 打开文稿时首选标签页”？\n设为“否”时，若系统设置配置为优先使用标签页而非窗口，则请求打开窗口时会改为打开标签页。设为“是”时，请求打开窗口可能会改为打开标签页。";
"Tabs: In the Compact theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "标签页： 在 Compact 主题中，可以从窗口边缘附近的区域开始拖动来移动窗口。此设置指定该区域的大小。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal and Compact themes when there is a single tab and the tab bar is visible, should dragging the tab bar move the window?\nThis also affects windows without titlebars in any theme." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 和 Compact 主题中，当只有一个标签页且标签栏可见时，拖动标签栏是否移动窗口？\n此设置也适用于任何主题中无标题栏的窗口。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how different should the background color of the selected tab be from the others?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is no difference and 1 very different." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，选中标签页的背景颜色与其他标签页的差异程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示无差异，1 表示差异很大。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how prominent should split pane dividers be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，分屏面板分隔线的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示不可见，1 表示非常突出。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how prominent should the tab outline be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，标签页轮廓的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示不可见，1 表示非常突出。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, should the area left of the tab bar be treated as part of the first tab?" = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，标签栏左侧的区域是否应视为第一个标签页的一部分？";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，可以从窗口边缘附近的区域开始拖动来移动窗口。此设置指定该区域的大小。";
"Tabs: Minimum tab width when using uneven tab widths for compact tabs." = "标签页： 紧凑标签页使用不均匀宽度时的最小标签页宽度。";
"Tabs: Minimum tab width when using uneven tab widths." = "标签页： 使用不均匀标签页宽度时的最小标签页宽度。";
"Tabs: Minimum width for tab labels.\nThe activity/bell icon will be hidden when the space for the label drops below this size (in points)" = "标签页： 标签页标签的最小宽度。\n当标签可用空间低于此尺寸（点）时，活动/响铃图标将被隐藏。";
"Tabs: Next Pane and Previous Pane commands use reading order, not the time of last use." = "标签页： “下一分屏面板”和“上一分屏面板”命令使用阅读顺序，而非上次使用时间。";
"Tabs: Place the tabbar in the window's titlebar in full screen mode (macOS 13+ only)?\nThis can be disabled to work around a bug in macOS where tabs may not be visible in full screen." = "标签页： 在全屏模式下将标签栏放置在窗口标题栏中（仅限 macOS 13+）？\n可禁用此项以绕过 macOS 中全屏下标签页可能不可见的错误。";
"Tabs: Preferred tab width when tabs are equally sized." = "标签页： 标签页等宽时的首选标签页宽度。";
"Tabs: Prominence of selected tab underline indicator in the Minimal theme when there is at least one colored tab." = "标签页： 在 Minimal 主题中，当至少有一个彩色标签页时选中标签页下划线指示器的突出程度。";
"Tabs: Remove the “new tab” button from horizontal tab bars?" = "标签页： 从水平标签栏中移除“新建标签页”按钮？";
"Tabs: Select tabs on mouse-down?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing windows." = "标签页： 在鼠标按下时选择标签页？\n更改此设置不会影响现有窗口。";
"Tabs: Select the tab to the left when closing a tab?\nIf disabled, the tab to the right of the closing tab will be selected." = "标签页： 关闭标签页时选择左侧的标签页？\n如果禁用，将选择关闭标签页右侧的标签页。";
"Tabs: Should double-clicking a tab open a window to edit its title?" = "标签页： 双击标签页是否打开窗口编辑其标题？";
"Tabs: Should middle-click on a tab in the tab bar close the tab?" = "标签页： 在标签栏中中键点击标签页是否关闭该标签页？";
"Tabs: Should tab close buttons always remain visible?" = "标签页： 标签页关闭按钮是否始终保持可见？";
"Tabs: Should the “new tab” button in the tab bar use the current session’s profile?\nWhen enabled, clicking the “+” button opens a new tab with the current session’s profile instead of the default profile." = "标签页： 标签栏中的“新建标签页”按钮是否使用当前会话的配置文件？\n启用后，点击“+”按钮会使用当前会话的配置文件而非默认配置文件打开新标签页。";
"Tabs: Tab bar height (points) for the Minimal theme.\nThe default is 38. Use 22 to match the compact theme's height." = "标签页： Minimal 主题的标签栏高度（点）。\n默认值为 38。使用 22 可与紧凑主题的高度一致。";
"Tabs: Tab width when the tab bar is scrollable.\nUsed as the fixed width when tabs are equally sized, and as the minimum width when uneven tab widths are allowed." = "标签页： 标签栏可滚动时的标签页宽度。\n在标签页等宽时用作固定宽度，在允许不均匀宽度时用作最小宽度。";
"Tabs: Uneven tab widths allowed." = "标签页： 允许标签页宽度不均匀。";
"Tabs: Use Sequoia-style tabs in Tahoe and later?" = "标签页： 在 Tahoe 及更高版本中使用 Sequoia 风格标签页？";
"Tabs: Use custom font size for tab labels?\nSee also advanced setting “Custom tab label font size”." = "标签页： 为标签页标签使用自定义字体大小？\n另请参阅高级设置“自定义标签页标签字体大小”。";
"Tabs: Use the running command's first letter as the tab's default icon if there isn't a built in one.\nThis takes effect when tabs are configured to use built-in icons." = "标签页： 当没有内置图标时，将正在运行的命令的首字母用作标签页的默认图标。\n此设置在标签页配置为使用内置图标时生效。";
"Tabs: Use “smart truncation” for tab titles.\nIf a tab‘s title is too long to fit, ellipsize the start of the title if more tabs have unique suffixes than prefixes in a given window." = "标签页： 对标签页标题使用“智能截断”。\n如果标签页标题过长无法容纳，且在同一窗口中具有唯一后缀的标签页多于具有唯一前缀的标签页，则从标题开头进行省略。";
"Tabs: Width of pinned tabs in pixels." = "标签页： 固定标签页的宽度（像素）。";
"Tags for organizing and filtering profiles" = "用于组织和筛选配置文件的标签";
"Tags to filter available snippets" = "用于筛选可用代码片段的标签";
"Template for log filename" = "日志文件名模板";
"Terminal background color" = "终端背景颜色";
"Terminal background color in dark mode" = "终端背景颜色（深色模式）";
"Terminal background color in light mode" = "终端背景颜色（浅色模式）";
"Terminal type string reported to applications (e.g., xterm-256color)" = "报告给应用程序的终端类型字符串（例如 xterm-256color）";
"Terminal: Accept OSC 7 to set username, hostname, and path." = "终端： 接受 OSC 7 以设置用户名、主机名和路径。";
"Terminal: Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds).\nThis is used by the password manager to ensure you're at a password prompt. Set to 0 to disable echo probe." = "终端： 测试回显是否开启的等待时间（秒）。\n密码管理器使用此设置确保您处于密码提示符处。设为 0 可禁用回显探测。";
"Terminal: Apps may turn on Focus Reporting.\nFocus reporting causes iTerm2 to send an escape sequence when a session gains or loses focus. It can cause problems when an ssh session dies unexpectedly because it gets left on, so some users prefer to disable it." = "终端： 应用可能会开启焦点报告。\n焦点报告会导致 iTerm2 在会话获得或失去焦点时发送转义序列。当 ssh 会话意外终止时可能会因此遗留开启状态而引发问题，因此某些用户倾向于禁用它。";
"Terminal: Automatically enable secure keyboard entry at password prompts?" = "终端： 在密码提示符处自动启用安全键盘输入？";
"Terminal: Automatically silence bell when it rings too much." = "终端： 响铃过于频繁时自动静音。";
"Terminal: Bounce dock icon when the bell rings while another app is active?" = "终端： 当其他应用处于活动状态时响铃是否使程序坞图标跳动？";
"Terminal: Command to run when handling an ssh:// URL." = "终端： 处理 ssh：//URL 时运行的命令。";
"Terminal: Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration, even when TERM matches *tmux*?\nThis was the default behavior for a long time, but it was incorrect. The conversion should only be done when TERM matches *screen*." = "终端： 在 tmux 集成中将斜体转换为反白显示，即使 TERM 匹配 *tmux*？\n这在很长一段时间内是默认行为，但并不正确。该转换仅应在 TERM 匹配 *screen* 时进行。";
"Terminal: Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration?\nThis is effective when the default TERM reported by tmux matches *screen*." = "终端： 在 tmux 集成中将斜体转换为反白显示？\n当 tmux 报告的默认 TERM 匹配 *screen* 时生效。";
"Terminal: Cursor blink speed (seconds)." = "终端： 光标闪烁速度（秒）。";
"Terminal: Cursor occupies line spacing area.\nIf lines have more than 100% vertical spacing and this setting is enabled the bottom of the cursor will be aligned to the bottom of the spacing area." = "终端： 光标占据行间距区域。\n如果行垂直间距超过 100% 且此设置已启用，光标底部将与间距区域底部对齐。";
"Terminal: Debug: highlight prompt mark prompt/command/excluded ranges in the legacy (non-GPU) renderer.\nWhen enabled, the legacy renderer overlays a blue outline around each visible prompt mark’s prompt range (OSC 133 A to B), a green outline around its command range (B to C), and a red outline around each excluded subrange (PS2 prefixes and right-prompt regions recorded via OSC 133 k=). Disable the Metal renderer (Settings → General → Magic) to see this. Intended for development and bug reports; leave off in normal use." = "终端： 调试：在传统（非 GPU）渲染器中高亮提示标记的提示符/命令/排除范围。\n启用后，传统渲染器会在每个可见提示标记的提示符范围（OSC 133 A 到 B）周围覆盖蓝色轮廓，在其命令范围（B 到 C）周围覆盖绿色轮廓，在每个排除子范围（PS2 前缀和通过 OSC 133 k= 记录的右侧提示区域）周围覆盖红色轮廓。禁用 Metal 渲染器（设置 → 通用 → Magic）即可看到此效果。仅供开发和错误报告使用；正常使用时请关闭。";
"Terminal: Default tab stop width for new sessions.\nNote: this will break drawing in emacs and other apps." = "终端： 新会话的默认制表位宽度。\n注意：这会破坏 emacs 及其他应用中的绘制。";
"Terminal: Disable animations for showing/hiding password manager." = "终端： 禁用显示/隐藏密码管理器的动画。";
"Terminal: Evaluate idempotent triggers periodically in interactive apps, even when triggers in interactive apps are disabled." = "终端： 在交互式应用中定期评估幂等触发器，即使交互式应用中的触发器已禁用。";
"Terminal: How long (seconds) terminal echo must remain disabled before iTerm2 treats it as a password prompt.\nThis prevents shell scripts that briefly turn off echo (e.g. while reading the response to an OSC report request) from triggering the password manager. Set to 0 to disable debouncing." = "终端： 终端回显必须保持禁用多长时间（秒）iTerm2 才将其视为密码提示符。\n这可防止短暂关闭回显的 shell 脚本（例如在读取 OSC 报告请求的响应时）触发密码管理器。设为 0 可禁用防抖。";
"Terminal: Initial alpha value when flashing the visual bell or search wraparound indicator" = "终端： 闪烁可视响铃或搜索环绕指示器时的初始 alpha 值。";
"Terminal: Maximum length for OSC 8 URLs" = "终端： OSC 8 URL 的最大长度。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of chunks to buffer.\nIn general, these chunks are 1024 bytes. A larger value increases buffer bloat but—up to a limit—can improve performance in the fast path of ASCII text." = "终端： 缓冲的最大块数。\n通常这些块为 1024 字节。较大的值会增加缓冲膨胀，但在一定限度内可以提升 ASCII 文本快速路径的性能。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of lines of history to expose to Accessibility.\nAccessibility APIs can make iTerm2 slow. In order to limit the effect, you can restrict the number of lines in each session that are visible to accessibility. The last lines of each session will be made accessible." = "终端： 向辅助功能公开的历史记录最大行数。\n辅助功能 API 会使 iTerm2 变慢。为限制其影响，您可以限制每个会话中对辅助功能可见的行数。每个会话的最后几行将被设为可访问。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of lines of history to restore.\nWhen the app is relaunched, only the last N lines of history are restored to avoid making launch too slow. If you reduce this number, existing sessions won't be affected until their history is cleared." = "终端： 恢复历史记录的最大行数。\n应用重新启动时，仅恢复最后 N 行历史记录以避免启动过慢。如果减小此数字，现有会话在清除历史记录之前不受影响。";
"Terminal: Minimum time between beeping or flashing screen on bell, in seconds.\nIf the time interval between bells is less than this amount of time, it will be ignored." = "终端： 响铃时蜂鸣或闪烁屏幕之间的最小间隔时间（秒）。\n如果两次响铃之间的时间间隔小于此值，则会被忽略。";
"Terminal: Never set the CTYPE environment variable." = "终端： 永不设置 CTYPE 环境变量。";
"Terminal: Number of screen lines to match against trigger regular expressions.\nTrigger regular expressions are matched against the last logical line of text when a newline is received. A search is performed to find the start of the line. Since very long lines would cause performance problems, the search (and consequently the regular expression match, highlighting, and so on) is limited to this many screen lines." = "终端： 与触发器正则表达式匹配的屏幕行数。\n当收到换行符时，触发器正则表达式会与最后一个逻辑文本行进行匹配。会执行搜索以查找行的起始位置。由于非常长的行会导致性能问题，搜索（以及随后的正则表达式匹配、高亮等）被限制在此屏幕行数以内。";
"Terminal: Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?\nThis is also known as the terminfo E3 capability." = "终端： 阻止 CSI 3 J 清除回滚历史？\n这也称为 terminfo E3 功能。";
"Terminal: Prevent control sequences from changing the current profile?" = "终端： 阻止控制序列更改当前配置文件？";
"Terminal: Regular expression for “Find URLs” command." = "终端： “查找 URL”命令的正则表达式。";
"Terminal: Restore window contents at startup.\nThis requires “System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an app” to be off." = "终端： 启动时恢复窗口内容。\n这需要“系统设置 > 桌面与程序坞 > 退出应用时关闭窗口”处于关闭状态。";
"Terminal: Set $TERMINFO_DIRS to add modern terminal features to xterm-like $TERMs?\niTerm2 ships with extended terminfo capabilities for common TERMs (xterm, xterm-new, and xterm-256color). For example, it enables undercurl. New sessions get created with a TERMINFO_DIRS that make the customized TERMINFOs take precedence over the system defaults." = "终端： 设置 $TERMINFO_DIRS 以便为类 xterm 的 $TERM 添加现代终端功能？\niTerm2 内置了常见 TERM（xterm、xterm-new 和 xterm-256color）的扩展 terminfo 功能。例如，它启用 undercurl。新会话创建时会带有使自定义 TERMINFO 优先于系统默认值的 TERMINFO_DIRS。";
"Terminal: Show key at cursor at password prompt?" = "终端： 在密码提示符处显示光标处的按键？";
"Terminal: Support TERM=screen\nMost notably, this fixes italics replacing inverse text." = "终端： 支持 TERM=screen\n最显著的是，这修复了斜体替换反白文本的问题。";
"Terminal: Tabs wrap around to the next line.\nThis is useful for preserving tabs for later copying to the pasteboard. It breaks backward compatibility and may cause layout problems with programs that don’t expect this behavior." = "终端： 制表符换行到下一行。\n这有助于保留制表符以便日后复制到剪贴板。它会破坏向后兼容性，并可能导致不期望此行为的程序出现布局问题。";
"Terminal: Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for background color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s background color will always be the cell’s text color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "终端： 智能光标颜色背景颜色的阈值（0 到 1）。\n0 表示光标背景颜色始终为单元格的文本颜色，1 表示始终为黑色或白色。";
"Terminal: Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for text color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s text color will always be the cell’s background color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "终端： 智能光标颜色文本颜色的阈值（0 到 1）。\n0 表示光标文本颜色始终为单元格的背景颜色，1 表示始终为黑色或白色。";
"Terminal: To drag images or selected text, you must hold ⌘. This prevents accidental drags." = "终端： 要拖动图像或选中的文本，必须按住 ⌘。这可防止意外拖动。";
"Terminal: Use P3 as default color space? If No, sRGB will be used." = "终端： 使用 P3 作为默认颜色空间？如果为“否”，则使用 sRGB。";
"Terminal: Use fallback for COLORFGBG if no exact match found?\nThe COLORFGBG variable indicates the ANSI colors that match the foreground and background colors. If no colors match and this setting is enabled, then the variable will be set to 15;0 to indicate a dark background or 0;15 to indicate a light background." = "终端： 未找到精确匹配时是否为 COLORFGBG 使用回退值？\nCOLORFGBG 变量指示与前景和背景颜色匹配的 ANSI 颜色。如果没有颜色匹配且此设置已启用，则该变量将设为 15；0 表示深色背景，或 0；15 表示浅色背景。";
"Terminal: Variables to report via control sequence\nThis is a comma-delimited list of variables that can be reported with the OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name control sequence. Each variable name must be prefixed with “allow:” or “deny:”." = "终端： 通过控制序列报告的变量\n这是一个以逗号分隔的变量列表，可通过 OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name 控制序列报告。每个变量名必须以“allow：”或“deny：”为前缀。";
"Terminal: Vertical offset for underline cursor.\nPositive values move it up, negative values move it down." = "终端： 下划线光标的垂直偏移量。\n正值向上移动，负值向下移动。";
"Terminal: Visual bell flashes the whole screen, not just a bell icon." = "终端： 可视响铃闪烁整个屏幕，而不仅是响铃图标。";
"Terminal: Warn if the `open` command appears to fail when secure keyboard input is enabled?" = "终端： 当启用安全键盘输入时 `open` 命令似乎失败是否警告？";
"Terminal: When evaluating idempotent triggers in interactive apps, wait this long (in seconds) between updates.\nThis limits the performance impact of trigger evaluation." = "终端： 在交互式应用中评估幂等触发器时，更新之间等待的时长（秒）。\n这限制了触发器评估对性能的影响。";
"Terminal: When files are dropped into a terminal window, execute a silent coprocess.\nThis is an interpolated string. Use \\(filenames) to reference the shell-quoted, space-delimited full paths to the dropped files. If this preference is empty, the filenames get pasted instead." = "终端： 当文件被拖入终端窗口时，执行静默协进程。\n这是一个插值字符串。使用 \\(filenames) 引用已 shell 转义、空格分隔的拖入文件完整路径。如果此偏好为空，则改为粘贴文件名。";
"Terminal: When rendering natively, use wide mode by default?" = "终端： 原生渲染时默认使用宽模式？";
"Terminal: When using “Find URLs”, extend results across soft boundaries like tmux pane dividers." = "终端： 使用“查找 URL”时，跨 tmux 分屏面板分隔符等软边界扩展结果。";
"Terminal: Width of vertical bar cursor." = "终端： 竖条光标的宽度。";
"Terminal: Zero-Width Space (U+200B) advances cursor?\nWhile a zero-width space should not advance the cursor per the Unicode spec, both Terminal.app and Konsole do this, and Weechat depends on it. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "终端： 零宽空格 (U+200B) 推进光标？\n虽然根据 Unicode 规范零宽空格不应推进光标，但 Terminal.app 和 Konsole 都这样做，且 Weechat 依赖此行为。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2。";
"Terminal: xterm version for secondary device attributes (SDA).\nIncreasing this number enables more features in apps but may break things. Use 95 to recover pre-3.4.10 behavior." = "终端： 用于辅助设备属性 (SDA) 的 xterm 版本。\n增大此数字可为应用启用更多功能，但可能破坏某些功能。使用 95 可恢复 3.4.10 之前的行为。";
"Test Connection" = "测试连接";
"Testing…" = "测试中…";
"Text color of selected text" = "选中文本颜色";
"Text color of selected text in dark mode" = "选中文本颜色（深色模式）";
"Text color of selected text in light mode" = "选中文本颜色（浅色模式）";
"Text for composer" = "组合器文本";
"Text is sent when you activate Semantic History on any filename. Use vim-style special characters. Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. " = "当您在任意文件名上激活语义历史时发送文本。使用 vim 风格的特殊字符。用 \\1 表示文件名，\\2 表示行号，\\3 表示点击前的文本，\\4 表示点击后的文本，\\5 表示工作目录。 ";
"Text template for the badge overlay" = "徽章叠加文本模板";
"Text to send to session after shell starts" = "Shell 启动后发送到会话的文本";
"Text:" = "文本：";
"The chat’s title will replace it when speaking to the AI." = "与 AI 对话时，对话标题将替换它。";
"The existence of buried sessions disables opening a window at startup." = "存在埋藏的会话时会禁用启动时打开窗口。";
"The existence of hotkey windows disables opening a window at startup." = "存在热键窗口时会禁用启动时打开窗口。";
"The presence of auto-launch scripts disables opening a window at startup." = "存在自动启动脚本时会禁用启动时打开窗口。";
"The prompt must contain the substring %@. %@" = "提示符必须包含子字符串 %@。%@";
