"This panel helps you configure a new profile that will be bound to a keystroke you assign. Pressing the hotkey (even when iTerm2 is not active) will toggle a special window." = "此面板帮助您配置一个新配置文件，并将其绑定到您指定的按键。按下热键（即使 iTerm2 未处于活动状态）也会切换显示一个特殊窗口。";
