"Tip of the Day: Time between tips (in seconds)" = "每日提示： 提示之间的间隔时间（以秒为单位）";
"Title" = "标题";
"Title of tmux pane for edit session dialog" = "用于编辑会话对话框的 tmux 面板标题";
"Tmux Integration: Close tmux windows after detaching?\nThis only takes effect when “Settings > Profiles > Session > After a session ends” is set to “No Action”." = "tmux 集成： 分离后关闭 tmux 窗口？\n这仅在「设置 > 配置文件 > 会话 > 会话结束后」设为「无操作」时生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Disable window position restoration in tmux integration." = "tmux 集成： 在 tmux 集成中禁用窗口位置恢复。";
"Tmux Integration: Don't automatically resize tmux windows" = "tmux 集成： 不要自动调整 tmux 窗口大小";
"Tmux Integration: Insert this string at the start of tab and window titles to indicate tmux integration." = "tmux 集成： 在标签页和窗口标题开头插入此字符串以指示 tmux 集成。";
"Tmux Integration: Open tmux windows and tabs in the background?\nWhen enabled, attaching with tmux -CC (or when tmux creates a new window) will reveal the window or tab without moving keyboard focus to it. Focus stays on the attaching session." = "tmux 集成： 在后台打开 tmux 窗口和标签页？\n启用时，使用 tmux -CC 连接（或 tmux 创建新窗口时）会显示窗口或标签页，但不会将键盘焦点移至其上。焦点保持在连接会话上。";
"Tmux Integration: Poll for foreground job name in tmux integration with tmux < 3.2?\nThis enables tab icons but can cause a lot of background traffic. This has no effect in tmux 3.2 and later, where polling is unnecessary." = "tmux 集成： 在 tmux < 3.2 的 tmux 集成中轮询前台作业名称？\n这会启用标签页图标，但可能产生大量后台流量。在 tmux 3.2 及更高版本中无效，因为无需轮询。";
"Tmux Integration: Remember window sizes in tmux integration?\nRequires tmux 2.9 or later. The “variable window size” advanced setting must be enabled." = "tmux 集成： 在 tmux 集成中记住窗口大小？\n需要 tmux 2.9 或更高版本。必须启用「可变窗口大小」高级设置。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of tab to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "tmux 集成： 隐藏询问在 tmux 集成中打开何种标签页的警告。\n注意：仅在现已弃用的「隐藏询问在 tmux 集成中打开何种标签页/窗口的警告」设置关闭时才生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration. Affects both windows and tabs.\nThis setting predates having separate settings for windows vs tabs. If it is off, then the two new settings will take effect." = "tmux 集成： 隐藏询问在 tmux 集成中打开何种标签页/窗口的警告。同时影响窗口和标签页。\n此设置早于窗口与标签页的独立设置。如果关闭，则两个新设置将生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of window to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "tmux 集成： 隐藏询问在 tmux 集成中打开何种窗口的警告。\n注意：仅在现已弃用的「隐藏询问在 tmux 集成中打开何种标签页/窗口的警告」设置关闭时才生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Tolerate unrecognized commands from server.\nIf disabled, an unknown command from tmux (such as output from ssh or wall) will end the session. Turning this off helps detect dead ssh sessions." = "tmux 集成： 容忍来自服务器的未识别命令。\n如果禁用，来自 tmux 的未知命令（如 ssh 或 wall 的输出）将结束会话。关闭此项有助于检测已失效的 ssh 会话。";
"Tmux Integration: Use black for filler area in tmux windows in full screen." = "tmux 集成： 全屏下 tmux 窗口的填充区域使用黑色。";
"Tmux Integration: When using tmux integration, should the tmux client name (typically the name of the attaching session or the host name) appear in brackets in the window title?" = "tmux 集成： 使用 tmux 集成时，tmux 客户端名称（通常是连接会话的名称或主机名）是否应显示在窗口标题的方括号中？";
"Tmux Integration: Where should new tmux windows not created by iTerm2 open?\n“Focused window” (the default) attaches the window as a tab of whichever iTerm2 window currently has keyboard focus. “Topmost session window” attaches it to the frontmost iTerm2 window that already shows a tab from this tmux session, regardless of focus." = "tmux 集成： 非 iTerm2 创建的新 tmux 窗口应在哪里打开？\n「当前焦点窗口」（默认）将窗口作为标签页附加到当前拥有键盘焦点的 iTerm2 窗口。「最前面的会话窗口」将其附加到已显示该 tmux 会话标签页的最前面的 iTerm2 窗口，无论焦点如何。";
