"Warnings: Suppress warning about sending a signal to terminate a job.\nThis is used in the process tree, which you can find the toolbelt or by clicking the Jobs status bar component." = "警告： 隐藏关于发送信号终止作业的警告。\n这在进程树中使用，你可以在工具栏或通过点击「作业」状态栏组件找到。";
