"While trying to load the setting for “%@”: %@" = "尝试加载“%@”的设置时：%@";
"Window Restoration Disabled" = "窗口恢复已禁用";
"Window style: normal, fullscreen, maximized, etc." = "窗口样式：普通、全屏、最大化等";
"Window transparency level (0=opaque, 1=fully transparent)" = "窗口透明度级别（0=不透明，1=完全透明）";
"Windows: Allow window resizing by dragging edges and corners?" = "窗口： 允许通过拖动边缘和角落调整窗口大小？";
"Windows: Amount of extra space (in points) between stoplight buttons and inline tab bar.\nThis only takes effect for the Compact and Minimal themes when the tab bar is visible and located at the top of the window." = "窗口： 红绿灯按钮与内联标签栏之间的额外间距（以点为单位）。\n这仅在 Compact 和 Minimal 主题下、标签栏可见且位于窗口顶部时生效。";
"Windows: Border color for focused windows.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb, or #rrggbbaa to also set opacity. You can also use p3#rrggbb or p3#rrggbbaa for p3 color space. Without an alpha component the border is drawn at 75% opacity. Requires “Show border around windows” with no title bar. Leave empty for the default color." = "窗口： 获得焦点的窗口的边框颜色。\n应为 web 样式颜色，#rrggbb，或 #rrggbbaa 以同时设置不透明度。也可以使用 p3#rrggbb 或 p3#rrggbbaa 表示 p3 色彩空间。不带 alpha 分量时边框以 75% 不透明度绘制。需要启用「在窗口周围显示边框」且无标题栏。留空则使用默认颜色。";
"Windows: Border color for unfocused windows.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb, or #rrggbbaa to also set opacity. You can also use p3#rrggbb or p3#rrggbbaa for p3 color space. Without an alpha component the border is drawn at 75% opacity. Leave empty to match the focused color." = "窗口： 未获得焦点的窗口的边框颜色。\n应为 web 样式颜色，#rrggbb，或 #rrggbbaa 以同时设置不透明度。也可以使用 p3#rrggbb 或 p3#rrggbbaa 表示 p3 色彩空间。不带 alpha 分量时边框以 75% 不透明度绘制。留空则与获得焦点的颜色相同。";
"Windows: Custom background color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "窗口： 分屏面板标题栏的自定义背景颜色。留空则使用默认颜色。\n应为 HTML 样式颜色，如 #aabbcc。";
"Windows: Custom color for split pane dividers. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "窗口： 拆分分屏面板分隔线的自定义颜色。留空则使用默认颜色。\n应为 HTML 样式颜色，如 #aabbcc。";
"Windows: Custom text color for pane title bars. Leave empty to use default color.\nThis should be an HTML-style color, like #aabbcc." = "窗口： 分屏面板标题栏的自定义文本颜色。留空则使用默认颜色。\n应为 HTML 样式颜色，如 #aabbcc。";
"Windows: Custom width for split pane dividers in points (1-5). Set to 0 to use default width." = "窗口： 拆分分屏面板分隔线的自定义宽度（以点为单位，1-5）。设为 0 则使用默认宽度。";
"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nOpen files in new windows, not new tabs or split panes.\nThis affects shell scripts opened from Finder, for example. See also “Open files in split panes”." = "窗口： 已弃用：请改用「新实例应如何打开」。\n在新窗口中打开文件，而不是新标签页或拆分分屏面板。\n例如，这会影响从访达打开的 shell 脚本。另请参阅「在拆分分屏面板中打开文件」。";
"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nWhen opening a file in a split pane, should it be a vertical split?" = "窗口： 已弃用：请改用「新实例应如何打开」。\n在拆分分屏面板中打开文件时，是否应为垂直拆分？";
"Windows: Dark themes give terminal windows black title bars by default." = "窗口： 深色主题默认为终端窗口提供黑色标题栏。";
"Windows: Disable documented edited indicator (black dot in close button)" = "窗口： 禁用已记录的已编辑指示器（关闭按钮中的黑点）";
"Windows: Disable the window shadow on High Sierra and earlier when the window has a transparent session to prevent text shadows." = "窗口： 在 High Sierra 及更早版本上当窗口包含透明会话时禁用窗口阴影以防止文字阴影。";
"Windows: Disable the window shadow on Mojave when the window has a transparent session to improve performance." = "窗口： 在 Mojave 上当窗口包含透明会话时禁用窗口阴影以提升性能。";
"Windows: How should new instances be opened when triggered by scripts or external applications?\n-1: Use legacy settings (default)\n0: New Window\n1: New Tab\n2: Vertical Split Pane\n3: Horizontal Split Pane\nThis provides a unified setting for controlling external instance creation." = "窗口： 由脚本或外部应用触发时，新实例应如何打开？\n-1： 使用旧版设置（默认）\n0： 新窗口\n1： 新标签页\n2： 垂直拆分分屏面板\n3： 水平拆分分屏面板\n这提供了一个用于控制外部实例创建的统一设置。";
"Windows: If the Profiles window is open, it always moves to join the active Space.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for a change in this setting to take effect." = "窗口： 如果「配置文件」窗口已打开，它总是移动到当前活跃的 Space。\n你必须重启 iTerm2 此设置的更改才会生效。";
"Windows: Include keyboard shortcut for windows in Window menu?" = "窗口： 在「窗口」菜单中包含窗口的键盘快捷键？";
"Windows: Left-align title bar in Minimal and Compact themes in macOS 26 and later?" = "窗口： 在 macOS 26 及更高版本中，Minimal 和 Compact 主题下左对齐标题栏？";
"Windows: Opaque windows have a border only in light mode.\nThis setting modifies “Show border around windows”. Borders in opaque windows in dark mode are ugly and the OS draws one that is pretty serviceable. Enable this if you have trouble seeing them." = "窗口： 不透明窗口仅在浅色模式下显示边框。\n此设置修改「在窗口周围显示边框」。深色模式下不透明窗口的边框很难看，而系统绘制的边框相当实用。如果你难以看到边框，请启用此项。";
"Windows: Should growing or shrinking the font in a session that's broadcasting input affect all session that broadcast input?\nThis only applies to changing the font size with Make Text Bigger, Make Text Normal Size, and Make Text Smaller" = "窗口： 在广播输入的会话中放大或缩小字体时，是否应影响所有广播输入的会话？\n这仅适用于通过「放大文字」、「恢复正常文字大小」和「缩小文字」更改字体大小。";
"Windows: Show secure keyboard entry indicator?" = "窗口： 显示安全键盘输入指示器？";
"Windows: Show window number in titlebar accessory?" = "窗口： 在标题栏附件中显示窗口编号？";
"Windows: Show window title when the tab bar is not visible?\nWhen disabled, the tab's title will be shown where the window title would normally go." = "窗口： 标签栏不可见时显示窗口标题？\n禁用时，标签的标题会显示在窗口标题通常所在的位置。";
"Windows: Simulated notch height" = "窗口： 模拟刘海高度";
"Windows: Terminal windows resize smoothly.\nDisables snapping to character grid. Holding Control will temporarily disable snap-to-grid." = "窗口： 终端窗口平滑调整大小。\n禁用对齐到字符网格。按住 Control 可临时禁用网格对齐。";
"Windows: Toolbelt font family name" = "窗口： 工具栏字体族名称";
"Windows: Toolbelt font size in points.\nSet to 0 to use the system default. Changing this setting does not affect existing windows." = "窗口： 工具栏字体大小（以点为单位）。\n设为 0 则使用系统默认值。更改此设置不影响现有窗口。";
"Windows: Use a tracking runloop for live resizing.\nThis allows the terminal to redraw during a resizing drag." = "窗口： 使用跟踪 runloop 实现实时调整大小。\n这允许终端在拖动调整大小期间重绘。";
"Windows: When opening multiple fullscreen windows, enter fullscreen one window at a time." = "窗口： 打开多个全屏窗口时，逐个进入全屏。";
"Windows: When restoring a window arrangement, ensure windows are entirely within the bounds of the current displays." = "窗口： 恢复窗口布局时，确保窗口完全位于当前显示器的边界内。";
"Windows: Width (in points) reserved for the window buttons (close/minimize/zoom) before the inline tab bar.\nThe default is 75. Reduce it to move tab content closer to the buttons, or increase it for more breathing room. This only takes effect for the Compact and Minimal themes when the tab bar is visible and located at the top of the window. Setting it smaller than the buttons themselves will let tabs overlap them." = "窗口： 内联标签栏之前为窗口按钮（关闭/最小化/缩放）预留的宽度（以点为单位）。\n默认值为 75。减小它可使标签内容更靠近按钮，增大它可留出更多空间。这仅在 Compact 和 Minimal 主题下、标签栏可见且位于窗口顶部时生效。设置为小于按钮本身宽度时，标签会与按钮重叠。";
"Windows: Windows have square corners.\nThis is only for users who have already hacked macOS to remove rounded corners. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "窗口： 窗口为直角。\n这仅适用于已通过 hack 移除 macOS 圆角的用户。更改此设置后必须重启 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Windows: Work around a macOS bug where the OS moves windows to the first display for no good reason." = "窗口： 规避一个 macOS bug，该 bug 会导致系统无端将窗口移动到第一个显示器。";
"Working directory option for new split panes" = "新拆分面板的工作目录选项";
"Working directory option for new tabs" = "新标签页的工作目录选项";
"Working directory option for new windows" = "新窗口的工作目录选项";
"Yes" = "是";
"You already have Profiles with Hotkey Windows named %@" = "您已经有名为 %@ 的热键窗口配置文件";
"You already have a Profile with a Hotkey Window named %@" = "您已经有一个名为 %@ 的热键窗口配置文件";
"You can provide substitutions as follows:\n  \\1 will be replaced with the filename.\n  \\2 will be replaced with the line number.\n  \\3 will be replaced with the text before the click.\n  \\4 will be replaced with the text after the click.\n  \\5 will be replaced with the working directory.\n\nThis is also an interpolated string evaluated in the context of the current session. In addition to the usual variables, the following substitutions are available:\n  \\(semanticHistory.path) will be replaced with the filename.\n  \\(semanticHistory.lineNumber) will be replaced with the line number.\n  \\(semanticHistory.columnNumber) will be replaced with the column number.\n  \\(semanticHistory.prefix) will be replaced with the text before the click.\n  \\(semanticHistory.suffix) will be replaced with the text after the click.\n  \\(semanticHistory.workingDirectory) will be replaced with the working directory.\n" = "您可以按以下方式提供替换：\n  \\1 将被替换为文件名。\n  \\2 将被替换为行号。\n  \\3 将被替换为点击前的文本。\n  \\4 将被替换为点击后的文本。\n  \\5 将被替换为工作目录。\n\n这也是一个在当前会话上下文中求值的插值字符串。除常用变量外，还可使用以下替换：\n  \\(semanticHistory.path) 将被替换为文件名。\n  \\(semanticHistory.lineNumber) 将被替换为行号。\n  \\(semanticHistory.columnNumber) 将被替换为列号。\n  \\(semanticHistory.prefix) 将被替换为点击前的文本。\n  \\(semanticHistory.suffix) 将被替换为点击后的文本。\n  \\(semanticHistory.workingDirectory) 将被替换为工作目录。\n";
"You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\(matches[i]) where i=0 for the entire match and i>0 for capture groups. For other values, see <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">Scripting Fundamentals</a> and <a href=\"https://iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">Variables Reference (Session Context)</a>." = "您可以在参数中使用智能选区正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\(matches[i])，其中 i=0 表示整个匹配，i>0 表示捕获组。其他取值请参阅<a href=\"https：//iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html\">脚本基础</a>和<a href=\"https：//iterm2.com/documentation-variables.html#session-context\">变量参考（会话上下文）</a>。";
"You can use captured strings from the Smart Selection's regular expression in the parameter. Use \\0 for match, \\1…\\9 for match groups, \\d for directory, \\u for user, \\h for host." = "您可以在参数中使用智能选区正则表达式捕获的字符串。使用 \\0 表示匹配，\\1…\\9 表示匹配组，\\d 表示目录，\\u 表示用户，\\h 表示主机。";
"You have enabled “Load settings from a custom folder or URL” in settings but the location is not set." = "您已在设置中启用「从自定义文件夹或 URL 加载设置」，但未设置位置。";
"You must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect." = "您必须重启 iTerm2 才能使此更改生效。";
"Your AI model list is already up to date." = "您的 AI 模型列表已是最新。";
