"When enabled, anything you type just after creating a session with this profile will be stored to be sent later. In order to stop buffering, you may either select the menu item Shell > Toggle Buffer Input, or you can add a Trigger with the action “Buffer Input…” configured to “Stop Buffering Input” to allow buffered input to be sent and keyboard interaction to work normally." = "启用后，使用此配置文件创建会话后立即输入的任何内容都会被暂存起来，稍后发送。要停止缓冲，可以选择“Shell > 切换缓冲输入”菜单项，也可以添加一个“缓冲输入…”操作并配置为“停止缓冲输入”的触发器，让缓冲的输入被发送、键盘交互恢复正常。";
"Some key reporting modes support additional modifiers of Hyper, Meta, and Super.\n\nA key mapped to one Hyper, Meta, or Super will work normally when the current key reporting mode does not support extended modifiers.\n\nRefer to the manuals for individual applications to see if they support these modifiers and how to configure them." = "某些按键上报模式支持 Hyper、Meta 和 Super 附加修饰键。\n\n映射到 Hyper、Meta 或 Super 的按键，在当前按键上报模式不支持扩展修饰键时将正常工作。\n\n请参阅各个应用的手册，了解它们是否支持这些修饰键以及如何配置。";
"Any session will switch to this profile automatically when your hostname, username, and current path match one of the rules specified in the adjacent table.\n\nA rule may specify a username, hostname, path, or job. It can also specify combinations of them.\n\nFor example:\n\n * `user@host:/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\nHostnames, paths, and jobs may use `*` wildcards. When a rule that had matched no longer matches (e.g., because the hostname changes), the profile switches back. You can prevent that by adding `!` at the end of the rule. For example, `user@example.com!`.\n\nSee the [documentation](https://iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html) for all the details." = "当你的主机名、用户名和当前路径匹配相邻表格中的某条规则时，任何会话都会自动切换到此配置文件。\n\n一条规则可以指定用户名、主机名、路径或作业，也可以指定它们的组合。\n\n例如：\n\n * `user@host：/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\n主机名、路径和作业可以使用 `*` 通配符。当已匹配的规则不再匹配时（例如主机名发生了变化），配置文件会切换回去。在规则末尾添加 `!` 可以阻止这种行为。例如：`user@example.com!`。\n\n详情请参阅[文档](https：//iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html)。";
"While this session has keyboard focus, the available Snippets will be limited to those containing all the tags listed in this field." = "此会话拥有键盘焦点时，可用的代码片段将仅限于包含此字段中列出的全部标签的那些片段。";
"When you double-click in the terminal, a single word is selected. When your click is on a letter, the word boundary is found by grouping letters adjacent to the click location. You can extend the set of characters that are treated as belonging to a word with this setting.\n\nFor example, if `/` is considered part of a word, then double clicking on a path would select all the path components.\n\nYou can choose to define the characters considered part of a word with a regular expression. Then you can add specific substrings, such as `https://`, if you would prefer double-clicks on URLs to include the scheme. Generally the regular expression you provide will be a sequence of alternates separated by `|`." = "在终端中双击会选中一个单词。当你的点击落在字母上时，会通过将与点击位置相邻的字母分组来找到单词边界。你可以通过此设置扩充被视为单词组成部分的字符集合。\n\n例如，如果 `/` 被视为单词的一部分，那么双击路径时会选中路径的所有组成部分。\n\n你也可以选择用正则表达式来定义被视为单词组成部分的字符。之后还可以添加特定子串，例如 `https：//`，这样双击 URL 时就会包含协议头。通常，你提供的正则表达式是由 `|` 分隔的多个候选项组成的序列。";
"When enabled, modifiers are remapped in a way that affects system shortcuts and third-party apps that receive keystrokes in the background. For example, if you remap the  ⌥ to ⌘ and **Remap modifiers globally** is enabled then you could press ⌥-Tab to switch apps." = "启用后，修饰键的重映射方式会影响系统快捷键以及在后台接收按键的第三方应用。例如，如果你将 ⌥ 重映射为 ⌘，且**全局重映射修饰键**已启用，那么你就可以按 ⌥-Tab 来切换应用。";
"Tabs: Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in light mode." = "标签页： 浅色模式下，非极简主题中未选中标签页的暗度（范围为 [0…1]）。";
"Tabs: Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in dark mode." = "标签页： 深色模式下，非极简主题中未选中标签页的暗度（范围为 [0…1]）。";
"Mouse: Scroll wheel up sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "鼠标： 备用屏幕模式下向上滚动滚轮时发送指定文本。\n该值应使用 Vim 语法，例如 \\e 表示 escape。";
"Mouse: Scroll wheel down sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "鼠标： 备用屏幕模式下向下滚动滚轮时发送指定文本。\n该值应使用 Vim 语法，例如 \\e 表示 escape。";
"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nOpen files in split panes.\nThis affects shell scripts opened from Finder, for example. You must set “Open files in new windows, not new tabs” to “No” for this to take effect. See also “When opening a file in a split pane, should it be a vertical split?”" = "窗口： 已弃用： 请改用“新实例应如何打开”。\n在分屏窗格中打开文件。\n例如，这会影响从 Finder 打开的 shell 脚本。必须将“在新窗口而非新标签页中打开文件”设为“否”此项才能生效。另请参阅“在分屏窗格中打开文件时，是否垂直分屏？”。";
"Pasteboard: Separator inserted between multiple clippings when sending or copying them.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\n for newline and \\e for escape." = "剪贴板： 发送或复制多个剪贴内容时在它们之间插入的分隔符。\n该值应使用 Vim 语法，例如 \\n 表示换行、\\e 表示 escape。";
"Pasteboard: Delay in seconds before the Return that submits an auto-sent code review.\nWhen the code-review workgroup toolbar auto-sends review results to the main session, it pastes the results and then sends a Return to submit them. This is how long it waits, after the pasted results finish, before sending that Return. A paste-debouncing TUI (such as Claude Code) processes a paste and a Return that arrive together as one batch, so the Return can be swallowed and the review never submits; the delay makes the Return land in a later read so it submits. The default matches Claude Code’s 500 ms paste-settling window. Set to 0 to send it immediately." = "剪贴板： 自动发送的代码审查结果在提交回车前的延迟（以秒为单位）。\n当代码审查工具栏把审查结果自动发送到主会话时，会先粘贴结果，再发送一个回车来提交。这是指粘贴完成后等待多久才发送该回车。具有粘贴防抖功能的 TUI（如 Claude Code）会把一起到达的粘贴和回车当作同一批处理，导致回车被吞掉、审查无法提交；此延迟让回车落在稍后的读取中，从而成功提交。默认值对应 Claude Code 的 500 毫秒粘贴稳定窗口。设为 0 表示立即发送。";
"Quad-click selects a string under the cursor that best matches a regular expression from a collection of rules." = "四击会选中光标下方与一组规则中的正则表达式最匹配的字符串。";
"⌘-Click on a filename referring to an existing file performs an action on that file." = "⌘-点击一个指向已存在文件的文件名时，会对该文件执行相应操作。";
"Experimental Features: SSH URLs respect the path.\nThey run the command: ssh -t \\\"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\\\$SHELL -l\\\"" = "实验性功能: SSH URL 遵循路径。\n它们会执行命令:ssh -t \\\"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\\\$SHELL -l\\\"";
"%@ color" = "%@ 颜色";
"Custom color for bold text" = "粗体文本自定义颜色";
"Brighten bold text" = "加亮粗体文本";
"Color presets" = "颜色预设";
"Set API key for AI" = "设置 AI 的 API 密钥";
"AI Plugin" = "AI 插件";
"AI default provider" = "AI 默认提供商";
"AI manual model default" = "AI 手动模型默认值";
"Manual model" = "手动模型";
"This action lets you exempt a keystroke from modifier remapping. For example, if you remap ⌘ to ⌥ but you want ⌘-Tab to work as though ⌘ were unmapped just for that keystroke, you would use this action and set the keyboard shortcut to ⌘-Tab" = "此操作可将某个按键排除在修饰键重映射之外。例如,若你将 ⌘ 重映射为 ⌥,但仍希望 ⌘-点击的行为如同 ⌘,可在此按键上使用此操作。";
"This action applies modifier remapping but prevents other programs from seeing the keystroke. For example, if you've swapped ⌘ and ^ and want physical ^-tab to switch tabs in iTerm2 instead of triggering the app switcher: bind ^-tab to this action. The system won't see the remapped ⌘-tab (so no app switcher), but iTerm2 receives it and can switch tabs." = "此操作应用修饰键重映射,但阻止其它程序看到该按键。例如,若你将 ⌘ 重映射为 ⌥,macOS 将看到 ⌥ 而其它程序不会收到任何按键。";
"Prevents the keystroke from being sent to the terminal while allowing macOS to handle it normally. For example, if F1 triggers a  macOS Shortcut, binding F1 to Bypass Terminal stops it from sending a control sequence to the terminal but still lets the system shortcut work." = "阻止该按键被发送到终端,同时允许 macOS 正常处理它。例如,⌘-C 仍会拷贝,但不会发送 ^C。";
"Prevents the keystroke from having any effect within iTerm2. Modifier remapping remains unaffected." = "阻止该按键在 iTerm2 内产生任何效果。修饰键重映射不受影响。";
"Switches tabs in most-recently-used order, like ⌘-Tab in macOS. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk back through tab history; release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the previously-selected tab, so binding this to a plain key acts as a toggle between the two most recent tabs." = "按最近使用顺序切换标签页,类似 macOS 的 ⌘-Tab。按住修饰键并反复点击可在列表中向后移动。";
"Switches tabs in reverse most-recently-used order. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk forward through tab history (oldest first); release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the least-recently-used tab." = "按最近使用顺序的反序切换标签页。按住修饰键并反复点击可在列表中向前移动。";
"Enter copy mode commands to move cursor, toggle selection, and so on. This key binding enters Copy Mode and then acts as though you had pressed the keys listed here. [See a list of all the commands](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html). Use vim syntax for control, option, and function keys (e.g., `<C-x>` or `<Up>`." = "输入 copy mode 命令来移动光标、切换选区等。此按键绑定进入 Copy Mode 并执行你输入的命令。";
"You can use this to copy information about the current session to the clipboard. [Learn more about interpolated strings](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html)" = "你可以用它将当前会话的信息拷贝到剪贴板。[了解有关会话插值字符串的更多信息](https://iterm2.com/documentation/interpolation.html)。";
"When set, the trigger fires only for the workgroup leader (the session that originally entered the workgroup). Peers such as the Code Review and Diff sessions do not, so reloading or quitting one keeps the workgroup open." = "设置后,触发器仅对工作组领导者(最初进入该工作组的会话)生效。";
"C-Style Backslash Escaping supports: \\a (bell), \\b (backspace), \\e (escape), \n (newline), \\r (carriage return), \\t (tab), \\ (backslash), and \\x followed by two hex digits giving a single byte of UTF-8.\n\nUnescaped Literal Text does not have any special characters.\n\nBackward Compatibility Escaping, which is not recommended for new snippets, supports: \n (newline), \\e (escape), \\a (bell), and \\t (tab).\n\n" = "C 风格反斜杠转义支持:\\a(响铃)、\\b(退格)、\\e(escape)、\\n(换行)、\\r(回车)、\\t(制表符)、\\\\(反斜杠),以及 \\x 后跟两个十六进制数字表示一个 UTF-8 字节。\n\n未转义的字面文本不含任何特殊字符。\n\n向后兼容转义(不建议用于新 snippet)支持:\\n(换行)、\\e(escape)、\\a(响铃)和 \\t(制表符)。\n\n";
"Special characters are:\n* \\<1-to-3-digit octal>\n* \\x<1 or 2 digit hex>\n* \\u<4 digit hex>\n* \\b for backspace\n* \\e for esc\n* \\f for formfeed\n* \\n for newline and \\r for return\n* \\t for tab\n* \\\\ and \\\" for literal \\ and \"\n* <C-x> for control key\n* <M-x> for meta key." = "特殊字符包括:\n* \\<1 到 3 位八进制>\n* \\x<1 或 2 位十六进制>\n* \\u<4 位十六进制>\n* \\b 表示退格\n* \\e 表示 escape\n* \\n 表示换行";
"The following will be erased and iTerm2 will quit immediately:\n\n\\u{2022} Preferences (profiles, key bindings, arrangements, advanced settings)\n\\u{2022} Saved windows and sessions\n\\u{2022} Python API scripts and runtimes\n\\u{2022} Secure settings\n\\u{2022} The contents of ~/.iterm2 and ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2\n\nItems stored in the macOS Keychain (such as the AI API key and Password Manager entries) are not erased and must be removed manually from Keychain Access if you want them gone too. On systems with networked home directories, secure settings stored under /usr/local are written by an administrator and may also need to be removed manually.\n\nThis cannot be undone." = "以下内容将被抹掉且 iTerm2 将立即退出:\n\n• 偏好设置(配置文件、按键绑定等)\n• 工作区排列\n• 工具带设置\n• 片段(snippets)\n• 全局备注\n• 标签页颜色\n\n此操作无法撤销。";
"The selected profile, “%@”, is a dynamic profile. These are generally only edited by hand.\n\niTerm2 is now able to write changes back to dynamic profiles when they are marked as “rewritable“. Rewriting can cause the order of values to change." = "所选配置文件“%@”是动态配置文件。这类配置文件通常只能手动编辑。\n\niTerm2 现在可以将动态配置文件保存到其文件夹中。要允许编辑它吗?";
"This will repair %d key binding that was corrupted by a bug in an earlier version of iTerm2. The affected binding currently displays incorrectly but functions properly. After repair, it will display correctly.\n\nAffected key binding:\n%@" = "此操作将修复 %d 个被早期版本 iTerm2 的缺陷损坏的按键绑定。受影响的按键绑定将恢复为默认值。";
"This will repair %d key bindings that were corrupted by a bug in an earlier version of iTerm2. The affected bindings currently display incorrectly but function properly. After repair, they will display correctly.\n\nAffected key bindings:\n%@" = "此操作将修复 %d 个被早期版本 iTerm2 的缺陷损坏的按键绑定。受影响的按键绑定将恢复为默认值。";
"You must install the following fonts to use the exceptions in this file:\n\n%@" = "使用此文件中的例外项必须安装以下字体:\n\n%@";
"Default tab bar height\\nThis does not affect the minimal or compact themes. On macOS 26 Tahoe-style tabs, the top (horizontal) tab bar uses the system height and ignores this setting; left/right (vertical) tabs use max(26, this value) for each tab’s height." = "默认标签栏高度\\n这不影响极简或紧凑主题。在 macOS 26 Tahoe 风格的标签页中，顶部（水平）标签栏使用系统高度并忽略此设置；左侧/右侧（垂直）标签页的每页高度使用 max(26, 此值)。";
"Scroll wheel up sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\\n" = "备用屏幕模式下，向上滚动滚轮会发送指定文本。\\n";
"Scroll wheel down sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\\n" = "备用屏幕模式下，向下滚动滚轮会发送指定文本。\\n";
"Scroll wheel sends arrow keys when in alternate screen mode." = "备用屏幕模式下滚轮发送方向键。";
"Regular expression for “Find URLs” command." = "“查找 URL”命令的正则表达式。";
"Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds).\\nThis is used by the password manager to ensure you're at a password prompt. Set to 0 to disable echo probe." = "检测回显是否开启时的等待时间（秒）。\\n密码管理器用它来确认您正处于密码提示符。设为 0 可禁用回显探测。";
"Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?\\nThis is also known as the terminfo E3 capability." = "是否阻止 CSI 3 J 清除回滚历史？\\n这也称为 terminfo E3 能力。";
"Prevent control sequences from changing the current profile?" = "是否阻止控制序列更改当前配置文件？";
"Disable DECRQCRA?\\nThis control sequence allows an app running in the terminal to read its contents." = "是否禁用 DECRQCRA？\\n此控制序列允许终端中运行的程序读取终端内容。";
"Timeout in seconds when running git for the status bar component." = "状态栏组件运行 git 的超时时间（秒）。";
"Show FPS meter\\nRequires Metal renderer" = "显示 FPS 计\\n需要 Metal 渲染器";
"Suppress the Restart Session offer.\\nWhen a session terminates, it will offer to restart itself. Turn this on to suppress the offer permanently." = "抑制“重新启动会话”提议。\\n会话终止时会提议重新启动自身。开启此项可永久抑制该提议。";
"Format for automatic session log filenames.\\nSee the Badges documentation for supported substitutions." = "自动会话日志文件名的格式。\\n支持的替换项参见徽章文档。";
"Show secure keyboard entry indicator?" = "显示安全键盘输入指示器？";
"Suppress warning “Shell Integration is required for Capture Output.”" = "抑制警告“捕获输出需要 Shell 集成。”";
"Suppress warning that the Captured Output tool is not visible." = "抑制“捕获输出工具不可见”警告。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line pastes (or a single line ending in a newline).\\nThis applies whether you are at the shell prompt or not, provided two or more lines are being pasted." = "抑制多行粘贴（或以换行符结尾的单行粘贴）警告。\\n无论您是否处于 shell 提示符，只要粘贴两行或以上就会适用。";
"Suppress warning about pasting a single line ending in a newline when at the shell prompt.\\nThis requires Shell Integration to be installed." = "抑制在 shell 提示符处粘贴以换行符结尾的单行的警告。\\n这需要安装 Shell 集成。";
"Always turn off focus reporting when host changes?" = "主机更改时总是关闭焦点上报？";
"Always turn off mouse reporting when host changes?" = "主机更改时总是关闭鼠标上报？";
"Always turn off paste bracketing when host changes?" = "主机更改时总是关闭括号粘贴？";
"Suppress the notification that the terminal attempted to access the clipboard but it was denied?" = "是否抑制“终端尝试访问剪贴板但被拒绝”的通知？";
"Suppress the notification that a restored session’s profile no longer exists?" = "是否抑制“恢复的会话所用配置文件已不存在”的通知？";
"Suppress the notification that a saved arrangement has a bad initial working directory." = "是否抑制“保存的窗口排列的初始工作目录无效”的通知。";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable mouse reporting that is shown after a drag followed by Cmd-C when mouse reporting is on?" = "是否抑制“鼠标上报开启时，拖拽后按 Cmd-C 所显示的询问是否禁用鼠标上报”的通知？";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable resize reporting" = "是否抑制询问是否禁用调整大小上报的通知";
"Suppress announcement that tmux will pause a session." = "抑制 tmux 将暂停会话的通告。";
"Send Clear Session to all broadcasted-to sessions?" = "是否向所有广播目标会话发送“清除会话”？";
"Disable control sequence to open URLs?" = "是否禁用打开 URL 的控制序列？";
"Open links using the in-app browser?" = "是否使用应用内浏览器打开链接？";
"Suppress the browser plugin upsell when clicking links?" = "点击链接时是否抑制浏览器插件推广？";
"Separator inserted between multiple clippings when sending or copying them.\\n" = "发送或复制多个剪贴内容时插入的分隔符。\\n";
"Delay in seconds before the Return that submits an auto-sent code review.\\n" = "自动发送代码评审时，提交回车键前的延迟（秒）。\\n";
"When the code-review workgroup toolbar auto-sends review results to the main session, it pastes the results and then sends a Return to submit them. This is how long it waits, after the pasted results finish, before sending that Return. A paste-debouncing TUI (such as Claude Code) processes a paste and a Return that arrive together as one batch, so the Return can be swallowed and the review never submits; the delay makes the Return land in a later read so it submits. The default matches Claude Code’s 500 ms paste-settling window. Set to 0 to send it immediately." = "代码评审工具栏自动向主会话发送评审结果时，会先粘贴结果再发送一个回车键来提交。这里设置的是粘贴结果完成后到发送回车键之间等待的时间。具备粘贴去抖的 TUI 程序（如 Claude Code）会把同时到达的粘贴和回车作为一个批次处理，导致回车被吞掉、评审永远无法提交；此延迟让回车落在稍后的读取中，从而成功提交。默认值对应 Claude Code 的 500 毫秒粘贴稳定窗口。设为 0 表示立即发送。";
"Warn before pasting when not at shell prompt?" = "不在 shell 提示符时粘贴前是否警告？";
"Tip of the Day: " = "每日提示：";
"Time between tips (in seconds)" = "提示间隔时间（秒）";
"Enable ad blocking in the web browser?\\nWhen enabled, downloads and applies ad blocking rules from the configured URL." = "是否在网页浏览器中启用广告拦截？\\n启用后会从配置的 URL 下载并应用广告拦截规则。";
"URL for ad blocking filter list\\nThis should be a JSON file in WebKit content blocker format. The list is downloaded automatically every 24 hours." = "广告拦截过滤列表的 URL\\n应为 WebKit 内容拦截器格式的 JSON 文件。列表每 24 小时自动下载一次。";
"Enable HTTP proxy for web browser?\\nWhen enabled, routes all browser traffic through the configured proxy server." = "是否为网页浏览器启用 HTTP 代理？\\n启用后所有浏览器流量都经由配置的代理服务器转发。";
"HTTP proxy hostname or IP address\\nThe address of the proxy server to use for browser connections." = "HTTP 代理主机名或 IP 地址\\n用于浏览器连接的代理服务器地址。";
"HTTP proxy port\\nThe port number of the proxy server." = "HTTP 代理端口\\n代理服务器的端口号。";
"Location of browser plugin if it cannot be auto-detected" = "无法自动检测时浏览器插件的位置";
"While loading the default smart selection rules" = "加载默认智能选择规则时";
"Han (CJK Unified Ideographs)" = "汉字（CJK 统一表意文字）";
"Greek (Greek and Coptic)" = "希腊文（希腊文和科普特文）";
"This histogram shows how much CPU time was used evaluating the regular expression for this trigger over the lifetime of the current terminal session. The X axis gives time in microseconds while the Y axis gives the number of samples which fell in that duration bucket. The vertical red line indicates the mean duration. You can use this to diagnose triggers that cause performance problems." = "此直方图显示在当前终端会话的生命周期内，评估此触发器的正则表达式所耗费的 CPU 时间。横轴以微秒为单位表示时间，纵轴表示落在该时间段桶中的样本数量。红色竖线表示平均耗时。您可以用它来诊断导致性能问题的触发器。";
"IntelliJ IDEA (Community Edition)" = "IntelliJ IDEA（社区版）";

"%@: %@" = "%@：%@";

"Snippets, notes, or icon customizations changed both on this Mac and in the settings folder “%@” since they were last in sync. Which copy would you like to keep?" = "代码片段、笔记或图标自定义在此 Mac 与设置文件夹“%@”中自上次同步后均有更改。您想保留哪个副本？";
